WEBVTT

00:00:50.072 --> 00:00:51.372
Come on, bro!

00:00:54.531 --> 00:00:55.531
Woo!

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:56.722
Woo woo woo!

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.340
- Whoa, whoa.
Hey, watch it!

00:01:16.580 --> 00:01:19.540
- You're in my way, bro.
- Oh, okay!

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:38.760
- That all you got?
- You want to go faster, huh?

00:01:46.684 --> 00:01:47.784
Woo!

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:57.428
This is cool, bro.

00:01:57.552 --> 00:01:59.746
Skxawng.
Let go

00:02:02.362 --> 00:02:03.980
It's cool riding with you, bro.

00:02:04.004 --> 00:02:05.010
High four!

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.688
All right. I gotta get back, bro.

00:02:15.712 --> 00:02:17.090
Little brother,

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.190
Tell me one thing before you go.

00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:23.210
How did I die?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.288
You got shot.

00:02:32.912 --> 00:02:35.563
We could have escaped.
But I made us go back for Spider.

00:02:35.887 --> 00:02:37.820
Then we had to go back.

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.605
That's not your fault.
- Tell that to Dad.

00:02:41.029 --> 00:02:43.480
We weren't even supposed to be out there.

00:02:44.804 --> 00:02:48.063
I got us caught because
I disobeyed orders.

00:02:48.087 --> 00:02:49.440
That's just you. Little bro.

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.810
- I love you, brother.
- Skxawng.

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:10.105
I killed my brother.

00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:12.690
No matter what happens,

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:16.330
I have to live with that
for the rest of my life.

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:58.589
- I wish I could do it.
- I wish I could do it!

00:04:00.189 --> 00:04:03.750
If I have another stupid seizure underwater.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.090
Yeah. You'd be me without a mask.

00:04:06.651 --> 00:04:08.831
(Choking sounds)

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.313
Let's test that.
See what happens.

00:04:11.337 --> 00:04:13.313
Hey, watch the stitches.
Watch the stitches!

00:04:14.437 --> 00:04:16.900
How do you like that, huh?

00:04:21.904 --> 00:04:27.404
♪ Lie si oe Neteyamur ♪

00:04:28.461 --> 00:04:34.294
♪ Nawma sa'nokur mìfa oeyä ♪

00:04:35.193 --> 00:04:39.773
♪ Atanti ngal molunge ♪

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:42.900
♪ Atanti ngal molunge ♪
- The fire of hate leaves only the ash of grief.

00:04:43.197 --> 00:04:45.036
♪ Mipa tìreyti, mipa 'itanti ♪

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.038
♪ Mipa tìreyti, mipa 'itanti ♪
- My mother mourned the ancient way,

00:04:47.962 --> 00:04:50.420
♪ Mipa tìreyti, mipa 'itanti ♪
- singing her son's life during the daily eclipse.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.520
♪ Lawnol a mì te'lan ♪

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.340
♪ Lawnol a mì te'lan ♪
- Because the light always returns.

00:04:56.655 --> 00:05:01.535
♪ Lawnol a mì te'lan ♪

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.063
There's the Na' Vi way.

00:05:05.487 --> 00:05:10.850
And then there's my Dad's way.
Say nothing. Keep busy.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:32.030
The reef people say,
the sea washes you clean.

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:34.430
Washes away your sins.

00:06:11.880 --> 00:06:15.063
What do you got?

00:06:15.087 --> 00:06:17.480
You're supposed to be collecting guns,
that thing's useless.

00:06:18.104 --> 00:06:19.600
Focus, boy.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.150
Don't let your mother see that.

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:38.610
Excuse me. Tuk...

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:50.140
- Bro,
- Oh sick.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:53.000
What is this?

00:06:53.924 --> 00:06:55.230
Tsireya,

00:06:56.254 --> 00:06:57.720
What are you doing?

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:03.340
- This is an AR, right?
This is the mag.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:05.688
That's where the bullets are ... empty.

00:07:06.912 --> 00:07:11.900
Slap it, rack it and then boom!
You can just spray.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.721
You can kill a lot of sky people with this.

00:07:14.745 --> 00:07:17.130
- See? Ceramic action.
You clean them and oil them

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:19.063
Be as good as new.

00:07:19.087 --> 00:07:22.355
This is not the Na' vi way. Jake Sully.

00:07:22.379 --> 00:07:24.150
Weapons of metal are forbidden.

00:07:24.470 --> 00:07:27.510
You know this.
To touch them poisons the heart.

00:07:28.869 --> 00:07:30.390
Eywa will provide.

00:07:31.990 --> 00:07:33.071
Right.

00:07:34.195 --> 00:07:36.396
The mourning period is not even over.

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.822
- Tuk.
- You should be with your family.

00:07:38.845 --> 00:07:43.310
Not gathering these things.
Your woman needs you.

00:07:45.430 --> 00:07:48.750
My son lies with the ancestors in the reef.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.390
This is our home.
I said I would stand and fight.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.021
But I can't fight gunships with spears.

00:07:55.345 --> 00:07:56.810
We sank the demon ship.

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:59.750
The pink skins fear us now.

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:04.390
Yeah, we got lucky.
And they got many more ships.

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:06.605
Least we got these.

00:08:07.329 --> 00:08:10.060
We are grateful you stand with us,
Jake Sully

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.188
It is not guns we need.

00:08:12.212 --> 00:08:14.230
It is rider of Last shadow.

00:08:14.854 --> 00:08:19.500
Ride Great Toruk, as you did before.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:25.640
When you ride the beast,
you become the beast.

00:08:26.640 --> 00:08:28.520
And the more blood, the better.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:33.990
I will not become Toruk Makto again.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:39.771
Jake Sully. You are always Toruk Makto.

00:08:39.795 --> 00:08:42.670
Come. Rotxo.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:49.696
Can you hear me?

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.250
Yeah, we can hear you.
Loud and clear. Go on, Doc.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.646
So uh, we've been through the wreck,
inside and out.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:59.880
And we searched through about
200 meter radius around it.

00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.600
We didn't find any Na'vi bodies,
just crew.

00:09:02.864 --> 00:09:04.844
Or.. what's left of it

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.920
- Well, keep looking, Doctor.
Expand the search radius.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:13.000
- Roger that. I would note though,
I did find an interesting new algae.

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:17.271
Sullys still out there.

00:09:17.295 --> 00:09:18.438
We don't know that.

00:09:18.462 --> 00:09:20.260
Scavengers could have
carried off the bodies.

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:24.660
Nope. He made it out.
And he's in this area,

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:28.060
down to a handful of villages.
You just give me a ship and I'll...

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.155
- I gave you a ship.

00:09:29.179 --> 00:09:30.471
It's right there on the bottom.

00:09:30.495 --> 00:09:34.580
- Yeah, along with my crew.
All dead.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:41.455
You brought me out here 26 trillion miles
for a single mission.

00:09:41.579 --> 00:09:47.540
A kinetic hard kill op against one guy.
I ain't backing off!

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.730
Hello? Do they have me on here?

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:05.530
The spirit of my ancestors is in this bow.

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:08.890
It was our strength.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.190
I can help you fix it, Lo'ak.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:19.300
No! It's ruined!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:22.820
Everything I touch gets ruined.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.188
They never talked about it,

00:10:30.712 --> 00:10:32.563
but it was there in the room.

00:10:33.487 --> 00:10:35.320
Like a crouching Thanator...

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:41.050
I know you will never give up your bow.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.050
So...

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:50.350
Just don't be close when it hits.

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:11.700
So you agree with Ronal?

00:11:15.140 --> 00:11:18.980
I will never speak against my husband
in front of that woman.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.480
Look, I'm a Marine.

00:11:24.504 --> 00:11:29.120
Not taking a knife to a gunfight..
Or a prayer.

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:33.790
So what am I supposed to do?

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:38.910
I can't run. I can't fight.
Oh, that's right.

00:11:39.630 --> 00:11:42.321
Eywa will provide. Yeah.

00:11:42.345 --> 00:11:44.588
So where was Eywa?
Where was Eywa when our son..

00:11:44.612 --> 00:11:45.830
- Jake!

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:50.870
I'm in this place where I have nothing.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.790
Not my people, not my forest.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:58.330
Even my father's bow is gone.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:04.788
All I have is my faith

00:12:04.912 --> 00:12:08.010
that this is the Great Mother's plan.

00:12:11.150 --> 00:12:12.550
You have this family.

00:12:26.920 --> 00:12:28.280
And you have me.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.080
And I love you so much.

00:12:56.020 --> 00:12:57.900
Yeah, Payakan!
You're the man!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:26.880
Yo! Yo!

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:30.700
This is sick.

00:13:38.126 --> 00:13:39.726
Wooo!

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.660
Go for it! Go go go go!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.260
That was insane, Cuz.
- I know, right bro

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:02.500
I thought you were dead

00:14:06.180 --> 00:14:08.188
It sucks that Payakan is still an outcast.

00:14:08.212 --> 00:14:10.771
Yeah, after saving
all our asses.

00:14:10.795 --> 00:14:14.500
No. I'm sorry. But by the
tulkun way he bears the deaths.

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.070
All those who died in the battle,
he bears those deaths.

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:24.030
I'm sorry. You saved us all.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.990
Forever, brother. Always.

00:14:41.269 --> 00:14:43.869
(Faint beeping)

00:14:43.922 --> 00:14:45.362
(Gasping for air)

00:14:47.000 --> 00:14:48.020
Dad!

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.621
- Wait. Where's the spare?
- It's in the basket I think..

00:14:53.545 --> 00:14:56.646
Get up. Wake up. Where's - hey!
Where's the spare mask?

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:57.670
- What?
- Where's the spare mask?

00:14:57.671 --> 00:14:58.671
It used to be there.
Where is it?

00:14:58.729 --> 00:14:59.729
- I don't know.
- Find it.

00:14:59.770 --> 00:15:00.813
It's not here.

00:15:00.837 --> 00:15:02.596
- Speak to me. Where is it?
- I can't find it.

00:15:02.620 --> 00:15:03.771
Hurry. Hurry. Where is it?

00:15:03.795 --> 00:15:05.075
- Come on. Come on. Come on.
- I got it.

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.521
- Dad. Dad!
- Hurry.

00:15:06.545 --> 00:15:07.560
I found it.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:18.940
Breathe. Breathe.
Breathe deep and slow.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.700
Deep and slow.
There you go, you're okay.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.820
I'm good. I'm good. I'm okay.

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:30.271
Skxawng. You have to be careful.

00:15:30.295 --> 00:15:31.946
Careful's my middle name.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.955
Yeah, skxawng.
You should be more careful, little baby.

00:15:33.879 --> 00:15:35.700
- Pay attention.
- Get off. Get off.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:40.290
- You have to pay attention.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:48.050
- The wind traders.
The wind traders are here.

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:51.855
The wind traders are coming.
Come on.

00:15:52.079 --> 00:15:53.210
Come on. Let's go.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:56.530
Come on. Come on.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:20.470
Hey,

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:37.850
Hey

00:16:39.534 --> 00:16:40.534
- Oh!

00:16:41.246 --> 00:16:42.746
Look!

00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:46.480
- Look at him.
It's not going to take up much room.

00:16:46.504 --> 00:16:49.440
As long as he's no trouble.

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:52.105
Take a knee. Let's go.
Tuk, Come on.

00:16:52.129 --> 00:16:53.855
Kiri.
Kiri, please.

00:16:53.879 --> 00:16:55.400
- Children. Please sit down

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:00.050
Your mother and I have come to a decision,

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.438
Spider. You're gonna live
back in high camp with Norm.

00:17:07.462 --> 00:17:08.610
- What?
- The Wind Traders will take you.

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:11.370
No, dad, you can't.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:14.630
Spider, you can't live
in a mask day and night.

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:16.513
I just want to stay here with you.

00:17:16.537 --> 00:17:19.410
- I know. But it's just too risky.
- This isn't fair.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:22.521
But please. You're the
only family I've ever known.

00:17:22.545 --> 00:17:23.813
- This is what's best for you.

00:17:23.837 --> 00:17:25.605
But dad, he's our best friend!

00:17:25.629 --> 00:17:28.105
- Can we just find a way?
- It's too dangerous.

00:17:28.129 --> 00:17:30.355
You're one dead battery away
from being dead yourself.

00:17:30.379 --> 00:17:32.146
He belongs with his own kind,

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:36.521
- Mom.
- And what kind is that, Mother?

00:17:36.545 --> 00:17:37.771
- Alien?
- Kiri

00:17:37.795 --> 00:17:39.388
- Pink ass?
- Stop.

00:17:39.512 --> 00:17:41.620
You hate them so much.
That's all you see.

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:43.955
It's Spider.

00:17:44.379 --> 00:17:47.313
Please, Jake, Mr. Sully.
I won't be any problem.

00:17:47.337 --> 00:17:48.355
You know that.

00:17:48.379 --> 00:17:49.410
Dad, this isn't right.

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:51.480
Spider is part of this family.

00:17:51.504 --> 00:17:54.688
He will never be
a part of this family.

00:17:57.390 --> 00:18:00.521
The caravan is the safest way to move him.

00:18:00.545 --> 00:18:01.850
- No. Please.
- He's going today.

00:18:01.874 --> 00:18:03.646
- You can't do this
- Alright, it's a done deal!

00:18:03.670 --> 00:18:06.896
Enough, it's not - this is a family.
It's not a democracy.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:09.638
- Alright.
- I hate you!

00:18:09.762 --> 00:18:11.280
- This is what is best, baby girl.
- No!

00:18:11.404 --> 00:18:13.450
- Hey, it's okay.
- Don't touch me.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:17.660
Hey. It's okay.
You understand?

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:21.020
- No.
- I already lost my brother.

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.340
I can't lose anyone else.

00:18:25.206 --> 00:18:26.306
(Hissing)

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:31.420
Sullys stick together.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:36.480
Yep. That's the family motto.

00:18:39.704 --> 00:18:41.280
- This is bullshit
- This isn't fair.

00:18:41.304 --> 00:18:43.950
Okay. Okay. Hey. All right,

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:46.870
How about this?
We all go together to drop him off.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:51.438
Kiri, you said you wanted
to see your grandmother.

00:18:51.762 --> 00:18:54.850
Yeah. It will be an adventure
for the whole family

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:00.990
Yeah. Cool.

00:19:14.450 --> 00:19:15.610
- Hey. Stay here.

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:21.250
Our arrangement was for
the pink skin boy only.

00:19:21.649 --> 00:19:24.610
- We won't be any trouble.
- You are already trouble.

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.770
A trader must move freely.
We cannot choose sides.

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:33.396
Having Toruk Makto on board cuts really close
to choosing a side in this war.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:35.890
Maybe you're mistaken.

00:19:35.930 --> 00:19:38.090
Toruk Makto was never on your ship.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:45.310
But if he was ever aboard,
then him and his woman

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:48.570
would be happy to fly as outriders
and protect your caravan.

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:53.188
Perhaps so,

00:19:53.212 --> 00:19:58.900
the Mangkwan raiders grow more aggressive.
Very well.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.580
I'm with you on this.

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:09.860
- Cast off!
- Come on.

00:20:14.018 --> 00:20:15.678
- Cast off below!

00:20:20.905 --> 00:20:21.905
Lo'ak!

00:20:22.750 --> 00:20:27.430
- Lo'ak!
- Tsireya! Tsireya!

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:29.190
Ready our bow!

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:34.030
Haul all lines. Come to starboard.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:47.310
Windward. Main shaft pull.
Pull out and race. Pull to windward

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.460
Lighten ship. Come up easy.

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:08.420
Windward and pull.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:57.220
Woo, yeah!

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:06.460
- Everyone mourns in their own way.

00:22:10.810 --> 00:22:13.530
For me, it's being up here alone.

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:17.850
I feel him with me.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:24.510
- Bro. Check it out.
- I hear his voice in the wind..

00:22:41.220 --> 00:22:42.300
Hold this.

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:52.805
Hey dad, I've been thinking.

00:22:53.329 --> 00:22:56.063
I should carry a rifle and
I can fly with you.

00:22:57.987 --> 00:22:59.810
That's gonna happen..

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:02.313
Why not? You trained me to shoot,

00:23:02.337 --> 00:23:03.630
Okay, I know what I'm doing.

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:07.521
Where's your comms?
I called you like five times.

00:23:09.345 --> 00:23:10.930
Where are your comms?

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:15.570
There's rule number one.
You can't even do that

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:33.040
That's it.

00:23:35.320 --> 00:23:36.355
What you got?

00:23:36.379 --> 00:23:37.730
So I promise this guy in imaging,

00:23:37.754 --> 00:23:39.730
a case of beer if he
ever got something for us.

00:23:40.654 --> 00:23:43.563
Long range patrols. Talk to these
guys when they punch our airspace.

00:23:43.587 --> 00:23:47.080
Routine fly-by.
Here's the enhanced.

00:23:52.050 --> 00:23:55.530
- Smile, bitches.
- When?

00:23:55.890 --> 00:23:58.770
13:50. Today.
I got coordinates.

00:23:59.270 --> 00:24:02.050
- Let's mount up.
- Thank you.

00:24:17.580 --> 00:24:18.700
Pull in hard.

00:24:36.620 --> 00:24:39.500
- Your pack?
- I'm good. I got plenty of time.

00:24:51.510 --> 00:24:52.550
Cleared ahead.

00:25:07.876 --> 00:25:10.176
Jake! Mangkwan!

00:25:12.390 --> 00:25:14.430
- Mangkwan Raiders, weapons up.
- Sound me the alarm!

00:25:21.710 --> 00:25:25.630
- Kiri, Go! Run!
- Go. Come on. Let's go.

00:25:25.630 --> 00:25:26.710
Let's go, to cover!

00:25:37.570 --> 00:25:38.472
Go, go!

00:25:38.795 --> 00:25:40.271
- Protect your sisters.
Can you do that?

00:25:40.295 --> 00:25:43.130
Yes, sir.
