Tuktirey..

00:59:44.158 --> 00:59:45.158
Kiri..

00:59:51.840 --> 00:59:55.360
Iron Sky Blue on actual.
We are inbound at the city wall.

01:00:07.040 --> 01:00:10.600
So you think he's still with Sully?
- I'd make book on it

01:00:10.900 --> 01:00:12.980
- This is not my priority.

01:00:13.004 --> 01:00:15.188
My priority is getting this city built

01:00:15.212 --> 01:00:17.321
and sending back Amrita to pay for it.

01:00:17.345 --> 01:00:19.480
- And who do you think sets
your priorities, General?

01:00:19.504 --> 01:00:23.000
It's the big picture, guys.
So here's a big picture concept for you.

01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:24.855
How are we supposed to colonize this world

01:00:24.879 --> 01:00:26.147
if we can't breathe the freaking air?

01:00:26.170 --> 01:00:29.380
- You want to find the boy,
you gotta find Sully.

01:00:29.880 --> 01:00:33.020
- And there...
- Ow! How many more of these, huh?

01:00:33.520 --> 01:00:35.771
- Not many more.
- That's what you said yesterday.

01:00:35.795 --> 01:00:37.896
Here's the most recent scan.

01:00:37.920 --> 01:00:40.550
Now, you see this? This is all mycelium.

01:00:40.550 --> 01:00:43.271
It's basically the same
thing as the forest network.

01:00:43.295 --> 01:00:47.230
Somehow it colonized him,
spread through his entire system,

01:00:47.254 --> 01:00:49.646
and then made changes
at the cellular level.

01:00:49.670 --> 01:00:54.271
I mean, look, it altered his blood
chemistry, his nervous system, his lungs.

01:00:54.295 --> 01:00:58.480
- Can you get it out?
- No. It's an endosymbiont.

01:00:58.504 --> 01:01:00.230
- We think they're keeping each other alive.

01:01:01.110 --> 01:01:02.855
It could kill him if we even try.

01:01:02.879 --> 01:01:06.771
- But look, I mean, he's.
He's alive, he's healthy.

01:01:06.795 --> 01:01:10.480
- Maybe this is a good thing.
- A good thing?

01:01:14.720 --> 01:01:17.520
What if the RDA labs
could reverse engineer this?

01:01:17.920 --> 01:01:21.040
What if every human being on Earth
could live here without a mask?

01:01:24.080 --> 01:01:27.680
Ah. Jake, there's something else. Sit.

01:01:28.000 --> 01:01:31.130
Hey, buddy. Okay, okay.
- Hey!

01:01:31.770 --> 01:01:33.930
- Hold. Hold still. Hold still. You're fine.

01:01:35.210 --> 01:01:37.430
- Ow.
- Look at that

01:01:37.820 --> 01:01:39.026
- What are you doing?

01:01:39.050 --> 01:01:41.530
- What is that?
- He's growing a kuru.

01:01:42.570 --> 01:01:44.290
- Wait, what?
- Oh, yeah

01:02:00.190 --> 01:02:03.390
Great Mother, are you there?

01:02:04.750 --> 01:02:07.550
Please hear my small voice.

01:02:10.110 --> 01:02:13.950
I prayed to you in the forest
to save my friend.

01:02:15.070 --> 01:02:16.430
I prayed so hard.

01:02:19.550 --> 01:02:23.560
But you didn't come.
You didn't answer.

01:02:24.040 --> 01:02:26.280
So I had to do it myself.

01:02:27.480 --> 01:02:31.560
I don't know how. I...
I asked the roots to help me.

01:02:32.520 --> 01:02:34.040
I don't remember how..

01:02:37.159 --> 01:02:40.200
Please, no. No.
Don't shut me out.

01:02:41.020 --> 01:02:42.413
Why am I like this?

01:02:43.537 --> 01:02:45.863
How am I doing these things?

01:02:46.187 --> 01:02:48.590
Please, just. Just talk to me.

01:02:49.030 --> 01:02:52.470
Please. No. No. Please.

01:02:52.630 --> 01:02:55.430
Please. No. No.

01:03:12.640 --> 01:03:15.146
You want that one? All
right, let's take these off.

01:03:15.170 --> 01:03:16.355
- Kiri...
- Run some more tests.

01:03:16.379 --> 01:03:19.440
Eywa never came to me.
I told you,

01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:22.800
I don't know how I did it.
- Drink.

01:03:23.520 --> 01:03:26.521
Kiri. My child.

01:03:26.545 --> 01:03:28.771
You are touched
by the Old Mother's hand.

01:03:29.295 --> 01:03:31.240
This we have known

01:03:31.520 --> 01:03:32.640
since you were born.

01:03:41.450 --> 01:03:43.021
There's something you're hiding.

01:03:43.045 --> 01:03:46.271
I have felt it my whole life.

01:03:46.295 --> 01:03:48.090
Just tell me the truth.

01:03:49.290 --> 01:03:52.490
Please..
- Tell her.

01:03:55.450 --> 01:03:56.510
It is time.

01:03:59.050 --> 01:04:02.910
- My child. You do not..

01:04:03.210 --> 01:04:06.240
have a father, Kiri.

01:04:06.980 --> 01:04:08.646
- What?
- You.

01:04:08.670 --> 01:04:10.180
You-Your mother.

01:04:10.420 --> 01:04:13.700
Okay. Gracie's avatar.
And when she was pregnant,

01:04:13.780 --> 01:04:16.771
Norm ran some tests
and it was a path- patholo-...

01:04:16.795 --> 01:04:21.380
- A parthenogenic birth. You're
genetically identical to the avatar.

01:04:21.620 --> 01:04:23.780
There literally is no father.

01:04:25.460 --> 01:04:28.420
- I'm a clone?
- Granddaughter.

01:04:29.310 --> 01:04:31.710
It was the will of Eywa.

01:04:33.390 --> 01:04:37.110
When the dreamwalker body lay here in the

01:04:37.610 --> 01:04:38.670
Great Mother's hands,

01:04:41.150 --> 01:04:42.990
a seed was planted.

01:04:56.120 --> 01:05:01.063
That really sucks.
That makes me even more of a freak.

01:05:01.087 --> 01:05:02.680
- No. Granddaughter.

01:05:03.640 --> 01:05:06.280
You are Eywa's child.

01:05:12.840 --> 01:05:14.520
I don't care how it happened.

01:05:16.040 --> 01:05:20.520
You're my baby girl,
and I'm the only father you'll ever need.

01:05:26.120 --> 01:05:27.320
- If I am so special,

01:05:29.320 --> 01:05:31.720
Why does Eywa fold her ears to me?

01:05:34.760 --> 01:05:37.813
Look, we don't know why,
but you're locked out from her.

01:05:37.837 --> 01:05:40.480
- It's some kind of firewall.
- Yeah, it's like an encryption.

01:05:40.504 --> 01:05:45.146
The harder you try to break in,
the harder it fights back.

01:05:45.170 --> 01:05:46.720
- Eywa has a path for you.

01:05:46.870 --> 01:05:51.271
Though she chooses to conceal it,
you must trust in her.

01:05:51.495 --> 01:05:54.830
- I have to find out what it is.
- No. You have to

01:05:55.130 --> 01:05:57.990
stop asking. Kiri, if..

01:05:59.030 --> 01:06:01.910
If- If you try to connect again,
you could die.

01:06:02.629 --> 01:06:04.950
You do it underwater and you will die.

01:06:09.990 --> 01:06:12.940
- He can't stay here. If the RDA get him.

01:06:14.290 --> 01:06:17.146
We will never stop 'em..

01:06:17.170 --> 01:06:20.813
If he is so dangerous to
the people, to everything.

01:06:20.837 --> 01:06:23.010
We should just kill him.

01:06:28.370 --> 01:06:31.370
It's Spider. He'll come with us.

01:06:31.870 --> 01:06:34.610
He'll come to the reef.
We can protect him there.

01:06:36.620 --> 01:06:38.938
Toruk Makto knows best.

01:06:38.962 --> 01:06:42.563
Come on, baby. It's not like that.

01:06:42.587 --> 01:06:44.300
- It is decided.

01:06:55.960 --> 01:06:57.960
30 Meters! Get me up in there.

01:07:04.950 --> 01:07:06.105
Get me in the pocket.

01:07:06.129 --> 01:07:10.550
Get me in the pocket with the rocket.
Ten meters.

01:07:13.110 --> 01:07:14.790
Here we go. And...

01:07:30.660 --> 01:07:32.820
Lung shot. She's bleeding out.

01:08:08.350 --> 01:08:11.950
A new demonship has come, bigger.

01:08:12.589 --> 01:08:15.950
More of our Tulkun have been killed.
- I'm so sorry, brother.

01:08:16.510 --> 01:08:20.230
- Jake Sully, the outcast is
stirring up the young bulls.

01:08:20.254 --> 01:08:23.500
Our Tulkun have called for
council to decide about him.

01:08:25.660 --> 01:08:28.396
You must rest.

01:08:28.420 --> 01:08:30.855
- This must be removed.
See me

01:08:30.879 --> 01:08:32.620
- Kids. Kids on me.

01:08:43.660 --> 01:08:45.563
No, I'm serious. When it grows long enough,

01:08:45.587 --> 01:08:46.855
I'm gonna get my own ilu.

01:08:46.879 --> 01:08:50.105
You skxawng!
You need a very small ilu.

01:08:50.129 --> 01:08:52.271
Just you watch. I'm gonna
get my own Skimwing.

01:08:52.295 --> 01:08:54.379
- Oh, Skimwing.
- Then I'll be the one laughing.

01:08:55.099 --> 01:08:58.219
So how is this? Your daughter?

01:08:58.699 --> 01:09:03.188
Your half-blood daughter .. with no training.

01:09:03.812 --> 01:09:08.605
Hold here.
Has done what no Tsahìk could do.

01:09:09.329 --> 01:09:12.271
- Who are you to question
the will of Eywa?

01:09:12.295 --> 01:09:15.669
- I am Tsahìk.
- Then be Tsahìk.

01:09:15.769 --> 01:09:20.188
These herbs do nothing.
Herbs from my forest heal faster.

01:09:21.412 --> 01:09:24.646
- I tell you to rest.
You do not rest.

01:09:24.670 --> 01:09:26.729
Then you blame my herbs.

01:09:28.329 --> 01:09:29.329
Hold still,

01:09:32.049 --> 01:09:33.113
Stupid woman.

01:09:33.337 --> 01:09:37.529
Careful, Tsahìk,
or I may forget that you are with child.

01:09:38.243 --> 01:09:40.643
(HISSING ANGRILY)

01:09:58.779 --> 01:10:00.096
The matriarch has spoken.

01:10:00.420 --> 01:10:05.159
She says the outcast continues
to defy the Tulkun way.

01:10:05.879 --> 01:10:07.313
All killing is forbidden.

01:10:07.337 --> 01:10:11.771
He was outcast for this,
but he has done it again.

01:10:11.772 --> 01:10:16.607
The outcast attacked the
demon ship, bringing death to our people.

01:10:18.450 --> 01:10:20.690
Even the son of Toruk Makto.

01:10:21.366 --> 01:10:22.366
- Dad..

01:10:22.390 --> 01:10:25.130
They can't blame Payakan for that.
- Not now.

01:10:31.270 --> 01:10:33.680
She says he continues to disrupt,

01:10:34.960 --> 01:10:37.440
spreading bad ideas among our young.

01:10:40.000 --> 01:10:43.980
- It's bullshit.
- It's not true.
She says he will only bring more death.

01:10:44.004 --> 01:10:46.880
- Hey, why don't you say something?

01:10:47.599 --> 01:10:49.380
Just say something, please.

01:10:55.200 --> 01:10:59.480
She says the outcast
may not stay in these waters.
- No..

01:10:59.504 --> 01:11:05.210
He must go far where his song
cannot be heard. Exile for life.

01:11:07.850 --> 01:11:08.930
- It's not fair.

01:11:11.610 --> 01:11:12.670
It is decided.

01:11:18.330 --> 01:11:22.090
- No, no! Payakan.
Brother!

01:11:22.730 --> 01:11:25.890
Please, no. Payakan. Brother!

01:11:33.410 --> 01:11:36.130
This is- This is wrong.
This is wrong.

01:11:37.410 --> 01:11:41.010
- You do not speak here.
- No. Payakan fought for us.

01:11:41.210 --> 01:11:42.221
He fought for us.

01:11:42.245 --> 01:11:43.490
He saved your daughter's life.

01:11:43.539 --> 01:11:46.246
He saved her life!
- This is council, you do not speak!

01:11:46.287 --> 01:11:48.170
- He defended us.
- This is counsel.

01:11:48.560 --> 01:11:49.605
- The elders have spoken.

01:11:49.629 --> 01:11:52.160
The Tulkun are being hunted.
They are dying.

01:11:52.860 --> 01:11:54.021
- Lo'ak, that's enough.

01:11:54.045 --> 01:11:56.496
- No!
- Lo'ak, speak the truth!

01:11:56.497 --> 01:11:57.571
- No, Tsireya.
- No!

01:11:57.495 --> 01:11:59.460
- Daughter.
- Payakan is a warrior.

01:11:59.820 --> 01:12:02.780
He fought for us more than you.
Or you.

01:12:03.420 --> 01:12:04.730
More than any of you.

01:12:04.754 --> 01:12:06.280
- He fought for us.
- Sit down.

01:12:06.320 --> 01:12:07.320
- Lo'ak...

01:12:07.420 --> 01:12:09.896
- Take him from here!
- Come on. Make a hole.

01:12:09.920 --> 01:12:12.620
- Dad, listen to him.
- We are in council.

01:12:13.308 --> 01:12:14.988
The elders have spoken.

01:12:15.270 --> 01:12:16.310
- What are you doing?

01:12:18.150 --> 01:12:19.563
- You never stand up for me.

01:12:19.587 --> 01:12:20.710
- Be seated.

01:12:20.818 --> 01:12:21.818
- Come on..

01:12:23.430 --> 01:12:24.790
- Council continues.

01:12:27.590 --> 01:12:29.855
We're at war.
You understand that?

01:12:29.879 --> 01:12:33.430
If you disobey orders, people get killed.

01:12:34.870 --> 01:12:37.396
With Spider here, we're
trying to keep a low profile.

01:12:37.420 --> 01:12:40.021
But that rogue is out there.
He's stirring up the young bulls.

01:12:40.045 --> 01:12:42.313
He was gonna bring
the whole RDA down on us.

01:12:42.337 --> 01:12:46.355
- You want him gone? That's
why you didn't say anything.

01:12:46.379 --> 01:12:49.188
- He's a loose cannon. He's just like you.

01:12:49.212 --> 01:12:51.471
In fact, if you hadn't gone
to him in the first place,

01:12:51.495 --> 01:12:52.563
if you hadn't disobeyed orders

01:12:52.587 --> 01:12:54.020
then your brother would still be...

01:13:01.060 --> 01:13:03.700
- That wasn't my fault... Dad, that..

01:13:06.050 --> 01:13:07.190
That's not my fault!

01:13:11.930 --> 01:13:12.970
Lo'ak.

01:13:30.070 --> 01:13:31.570
Go to him, Jake.

01:13:35.750 --> 01:13:37.350
Or you will lose another son.

01:13:41.130 --> 01:13:42.890
- I got nothing to say to him.

01:13:45.430 --> 01:13:46.830
Do not blame Lo'ak.

01:13:50.110 --> 01:13:52.188
You said you could protect this family.

01:13:52.212 --> 01:13:53.470
That you could do.

01:13:54.830 --> 01:13:56.480
- Yeah. I thought we would be safe here.

01:13:56.504 --> 01:13:58.938
- Our son is dead, Jake.

01:13:59.062 --> 01:14:00.860
- I was wrong.

01:14:02.880 --> 01:14:04.146
What do you want me to say?

01:14:04.150 --> 01:14:06.568
That every decision
that I made for this family is wrong?

01:14:07.112 --> 01:14:09.120
I killed our son?

01:14:14.360 --> 01:14:16.520
- And still we are here in this place,

01:14:17.640 --> 01:14:21.400
Hiding this pink skin.
This alien.

01:14:22.280 --> 01:14:25.670
If I had to choose between
my family and a pink skin,

01:14:26.130 --> 01:14:29.921
I would kill him right now.
- Stop, stop. Stop.

01:14:30.045 --> 01:14:32.390
We're not doing this.
We're not doing this.

01:14:33.510 --> 01:14:36.950
You already chose between
your family and a pink skin

01:14:36.951 --> 01:14:37.971
Once, remember?

01:14:42.630 --> 01:14:46.630
You cannot live like this, baby.
In "hate".

01:14:48.560 --> 01:14:51.360
- I hate them, Jake.
I hate them.

01:14:52.960 --> 01:14:56.000
I hate them.
I hate their pink little hands.

01:14:57.440 --> 01:15:00.080
I hate the insanity in their minds,

01:15:03.200 --> 01:15:05.848
- I'm human, inside.

01:15:06.472 --> 01:15:08.663
You hate me?

01:15:09.887 --> 01:15:12.005
I'll always be an alien to you, won't I?

01:15:12.929 --> 01:15:15.390
Doesn't matter how
long I live in this skin.

01:15:17.060 --> 01:15:21.896
Do you hate your children
with their alien hands?

01:15:21.920 --> 01:15:24.180
- No.

01:15:25.540 --> 01:15:28.980
- Are you ashamed every time
they make a mistake,

01:15:28.980 --> 01:15:31.971
every time they're different,

01:15:32.095 --> 01:15:34.500
that's because of
the human inside them, right?

01:15:37.280 --> 01:15:38.340
- Yes.

01:15:57.230 --> 01:15:59.710
Sorry, baby. I'm sorry.

01:16:01.150 --> 01:16:02.150
I'm sorry.

01:16:05.470 --> 01:16:08.610
We have to stand strong right now,

01:16:10.210 --> 01:16:11.890
this family is our fortress.

01:16:35.080 --> 01:16:36.920
The people say that when you touch steel,

01:16:38.200 --> 01:16:39.640
its poison seeps into your heart,

01:17:04.962 --> 01:17:05.962
- Lo'ak!

01:17:07.420 --> 01:17:08.700
- Brother.
- Lo'ak!

01:17:14.740 --> 01:17:16.420
- Stay in this life, brother.

01:17:18.900 --> 01:17:22.013
- We need you.
- We love you.

01:17:22.137 --> 01:17:23.730
- You have greatness in you.

01:17:39.250 --> 01:17:42.130
The strength of the ancestors is here.

01:17:46.370 --> 01:17:47.730
A bow can be fixed.

01:18:05.200 --> 01:18:06.700
Good, good.

01:18:15.730 --> 01:18:16.730
Moment of truth.

01:18:29.130 --> 01:18:30.130
Go.

01:18:34.490 --> 01:18:38.330
You feel her?
- Oh, yeah. I got fins.

01:18:39.690 --> 01:18:40.810
Yeah, you. You do.

01:18:41.126 --> 01:18:43.126
(Cheering)

01:18:44.010 --> 01:18:45.870
- Woo!
- Go. Monkey boy.

01:19:04.730 --> 01:19:05.910
You! Face them!

01:19:08.740 --> 01:19:10.980
Stay calm! Stay calm.

01:19:13.500 --> 01:19:17.088
- Spider.
- I think we're wasting our time, Colonel.

01:19:17.212 --> 01:19:21.080
- They don't know anything.
- Oh, they know. They're just not talking.

01:19:23.140 --> 01:19:26.260
We got one more play, but it's radical.

01:20:09.420 --> 01:20:11.180
Hey. You remember me, don't you?

01:20:12.900 --> 01:20:15.900
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Just relax.
- Mine! Get him up.

01:20:16.001 --> 01:20:17.575
- I brought something for your Tsahìk.

01:20:18.500 --> 01:20:20.720
You take me to your Tsahìk.

01:20:21.240 --> 01:20:23.830
- Move!
- Hey, hey! No need to do that.

01:20:24.150 --> 01:20:26.070
- I got my eye on you.
- Keep going.

01:20:43.520 --> 01:20:45.520
- Tsahìk!

01:21:07.720 --> 01:21:09.320
I'll get you as many as you want.

01:21:20.530 --> 01:21:22.850
What is your name, sky man?

01:21:23.610 --> 01:21:27.610
Quaritch.
Colonel Miles Quaritch.

01:21:33.050 --> 01:21:35.105
You touch me with that
thing again, I'll kill you.

01:21:35.129 --> 01:21:37.771
- You will kill no one,

01:21:39.795 --> 01:21:42.660
- Lady. I'm gonna beg to differ.

01:21:42.781 --> 01:21:43.781
Drop him.

01:22:08.350 --> 01:22:09.370
Good trick.

01:22:11.230 --> 01:22:15.230
- Quaritch.
- You're next cupcake.

01:22:15.790 --> 01:22:17.870
So think careful about what you want to do.

01:22:21.130 --> 01:22:24.970
Come. We will talk inside.

01:22:31.820 --> 01:22:32.940
What are you doing, boss?

01:22:50.840 --> 01:22:51.840
Cozy.

01:22:54.680 --> 01:22:59.730
The thing is,
everybody's lying to me.

01:23:06.770 --> 01:23:12.021
They say that you can make stone
speak the truth.

01:23:12.045 --> 01:23:15.896
- You seek a man.
The other sky man like you?

01:23:16.820 --> 01:23:18.790
- Not like me.

01:23:19.410 --> 01:23:21.021
No, he's a traitor.

01:23:22.045 --> 01:23:24.021
- Then he must die.

01:23:26.045 --> 01:23:28.730
Varang can help you find this man.

01:23:30.054 --> 01:23:33.480
And the other you seek.

01:23:34.204 --> 01:23:36.881
This air breather.

01:23:43.460 --> 01:23:46.020
First, I must see your soul.

01:23:47.370 --> 01:23:48.450
Be still.

01:23:50.090 --> 01:23:51.110
Be still.

01:24:14.640 --> 01:24:16.260
That's some strong shit.

01:24:52.420 --> 01:24:58.340
This... is the only pure thing in this world.

01:25:01.420 --> 01:25:04.630
The fire came from the mountain
when I was little.

01:25:06.670 --> 01:25:08.030
Burnt our forest.

01:25:10.630 --> 01:25:12.550
It took everything.

01:25:16.910 --> 01:25:19.709
My people were starving.

01:25:20.690 --> 01:25:22.530
They cried for help.

01:25:25.650 --> 01:25:28.290
But Eywa did not come.

01:25:30.520 --> 01:25:34.160
So I went to the fire.

01:25:37.200 --> 01:25:39.760
And I learned its way.

01:25:45.000 --> 01:25:48.080
I am the fire.

01:25:50.240 --> 01:25:52.513
By my hand.

01:25:52.837 --> 01:25:54.988
My people grow strong.

01:25:55.212 --> 01:25:58.680
We do not lies down and die

01:25:58.804 --> 01:26:01.730
just because Eywas turns her back on us.

01:26:04.090 --> 01:26:06.890
We turn our back on Eywa.

01:26:08.550 --> 01:26:12.910
A weak mother for weak children.

01:26:15.850 --> 01:26:21.020
We do not suck on
the breast of weakness.

01:26:25.521 --> 01:26:27.021
Now...

01:26:29.140 --> 01:26:34.580
Only true words
will come from your tongue.

01:26:40.260 --> 01:26:43.940
You have a strong heart.
No fear.

01:26:44.584 --> 01:26:45.584
- Ow!

01:26:47.130 --> 01:26:49.850
Ow.. That wasn't cool.

01:26:50.269 --> 01:26:52.602
- I will eat your heart, Quaritch.

01:26:58.610 --> 01:27:01.810
But first you will answer me.

01:27:05.530 --> 01:27:07.130
Why are you here?

01:27:12.580 --> 01:27:13.700
I'm here for you.

01:27:15.500 --> 01:27:18.080
You wish to serve me?

01:27:18.904 --> 01:27:23.700
I don't serve anybody.
I need you.

01:27:25.380 --> 01:27:28.146
Well, I do not need you.

01:27:28.470 --> 01:27:30.855
And I might keep you

01:27:30.879 --> 01:27:35.296
as my slave... to pleasure me.

01:27:35.820 --> 01:27:37.260
That sounds like a fun weekend.

01:27:38.010 --> 01:27:42.405
But that's not what you really want.

01:27:42.529 --> 01:27:43.790
- What do I want?

01:27:46.050 --> 01:27:47.410
- What you've never had.

01:27:50.210 --> 01:27:51.290
An equal.

01:27:55.290 --> 01:27:58.090
You want to spread your fire
across the world?

01:27:59.090 --> 01:28:02.530
Yeah. I'll give you guns.

01:28:03.420 --> 01:28:06.620
I'll give you comms, RPGs.

01:28:07.420 --> 01:28:10.105
Oh, that's strong magic..

01:28:10.429 --> 01:28:14.280
Command from a distance,
strike like lightning.

01:28:15.300 --> 01:28:20.988
The clans, as far as you can fly.

01:28:21.212 --> 01:28:23.020
They'll bow down before Varang.

01:28:29.530 --> 01:28:30.970
You want to take on Eywa?

01:28:33.510 --> 01:28:34.550
You need me.

01:28:40.250 --> 01:28:41.290
I see you,

01:28:43.450 --> 01:28:44.809
Damn right, you do.

01:30:04.369 --> 01:30:07.089
When I can connect again.
Someday.

01:30:08.689 --> 01:30:12.689
Whenever.. I can be your guide
in the spirit world.

01:30:14.459 --> 01:30:16.619
Well, can I just go now?

01:30:17.419 --> 01:30:19.687
- No. Not without me.

01:30:20.511 --> 01:30:23.445
A sky person can't just show up,

01:30:23.469 --> 01:30:25.579
it'd freak out the ancestors.

01:30:36.139 --> 01:30:39.819
They're starting to arrive
for the calf communion.

01:30:42.029 --> 01:30:45.309
Yearling calves and reef babies together.

01:30:46.149 --> 01:30:49.829
Having the first bond with Eywa.
It'll be so beautiful.

01:31:17.508 --> 01:31:18.508
Let me see.

01:31:18.679 --> 01:31:21.239
It's good. I like this on you.

01:31:22.199 --> 01:31:24.199
- Come to the festival.
- No no no no no..

01:31:25.959 --> 01:31:27.999
- Then I will just stay here with you.

01:31:35.949 --> 01:31:41.429
Lo'ak, I should not tell you this,
but my tulkun sister says

01:31:41.453 --> 01:31:44.689
they have been hearing Payakan very faint.

01:31:44.769 --> 01:31:46.845
Calling to his birth clan.
- Where?

01:31:48.269 --> 01:31:51.054
Tulkun song travels very far
through the water, Lo'ak.

01:31:51.278 --> 01:31:52.449
Please,

01:32:22.599 --> 01:32:23.639
Lo'ak.

01:32:27.659 --> 01:32:31.019
- Bye Mom.
- Where are you going?

01:32:33.479 --> 01:32:34.519
Just out.

01:32:36.839 --> 01:32:38.119
There's something I have to do.

01:32:46.769 --> 01:32:47.849
Lo'ak.

01:32:49.969 --> 01:32:54.149
Lo'ak. Lo'ak,
wait!

01:32:56.249 --> 01:32:57.529
Lo'ak.

01:33:13.979 --> 01:33:16.762
We cannot go. The calf
communion is in five days.

01:33:16.786 --> 01:33:19.262
I have to go.
This is my fault.

01:33:19.286 --> 01:33:20.379
We are going.

01:33:21.779 --> 01:33:25.179
All of us.
Get weapons and food.

01:33:25.739 --> 01:33:26.739
Tell no one.

01:33:34.379 --> 01:33:37.909
Our children have gone to look for him.
- You let them?

01:33:38.549 --> 01:33:40.595
They did not ask.

01:33:40.619 --> 01:33:42.529
Alright, we'll get the raiders, we go after them.

01:33:42.529 --> 01:33:44.637
- We cannot search the whole ocean.

01:33:44.661 --> 01:33:46.509
We need the warriors here
for calf communion.

01:33:46.609 --> 01:33:50.389
- If the demon ships come,
- My boy is out there by himself.

01:33:51.909 --> 01:33:54.869
He will come back when he is ready.

01:33:55.909 --> 01:33:57.109
This is his path.

01:34:02.069 --> 01:34:03.189
Look at what he did,

01:34:05.489 --> 01:34:10.279
Jake. The strength of the
ancestors runs in your son's veins.

01:34:10.503 --> 01:34:11.789
You must trust that.

01:34:18.129 --> 01:34:20.609
The way of water has no beginning,

01:34:23.649 --> 01:34:25.809
no end. The sea is your home.

01:34:31.419 --> 01:34:32.499
Before your birth.

01:34:39.259 --> 01:34:40.299
And after your death.

01:35:03.049 --> 01:35:06.569
Where is the one they call Toruk Makto?

01:35:07.429 --> 01:35:09.929
How many fish are in the sea?
1, 2.

01:35:09.953 --> 01:35:13.304
How many birds are in the sky?
1, 2, 3 -

01:35:14.728 --> 01:35:16.345
I mean, come on.
You couldn't have asked Eywa

01:35:16.369 --> 01:35:17.720
To make
me a little bit taller?

01:35:17.744 --> 01:35:19.179
Maybe even a little bit more blue?

01:35:19.203 --> 01:35:23.846
- No.. I was busy saving your life.
Skxawng

01:35:24.069 --> 01:35:26.379
- Just a little bit. A couple centimeters.

01:35:28.759 --> 01:35:30.999
She's the All Mother.
She can do anything.

01:35:33.559 --> 01:35:36.279
You are perfect just the way you are.

01:35:56.509 --> 01:35:57.629
Come on, monkey boy.

01:36:01.009 --> 01:36:03.489
So, next thing is I'm gonna learn
how to ride a skimwing.

01:36:04.209 --> 01:36:07.649
- So you can become a mighty warrior
and protect us all?

01:36:07.809 --> 01:36:09.679
Hey. It's not the size
of the dog in the fight.

01:36:09.703 --> 01:36:12.099
It's the size of fight in the dog.

01:36:12.472 --> 01:36:13.672
What is it?

01:36:20.539 --> 01:36:22.339
Run. Run!

01:36:31.739 --> 01:36:33.399
Go. Go!

01:36:34.700 --> 01:36:35.700
- Spider?

01:36:35.979 --> 01:36:40.149
- Over here, assholes!
Come on!

01:36:40.789 --> 01:36:43.989
Hey, skxawng!
This way, you bastards!

01:36:45.829 --> 01:36:49.269
Come on, dipshit!
Is that all you've got?

01:36:51.084 --> 01:36:52.084
Shit!

01:36:54.949 --> 01:36:58.345
Settle down there, cowboy.
Careful with that knife.

01:36:58.369 --> 01:36:59.589
That's how people get hurt.

01:37:01.637 --> 01:37:03.637
- Air breather.

01:37:18.159 --> 01:37:21.137
We fly.
- Break off.

01:37:21.161 --> 01:37:23.679
Dragonfly. Blue one,
you are cleared in.

01:37:39.366 --> 01:37:40.366
Tuk!

01:37:47.929 --> 01:37:49.512
They're blocking us in.
Weapons up.

01:37:49.536 --> 01:37:50.595
Weapons.

01:37:50.619 --> 01:37:52.554
- Where's your sister?
- She went for water.

01:37:52.578 --> 01:37:53.929
Where's Kiri?
Where's Spider?

01:37:57.019 --> 01:37:58.970
- Dad,
- Where's Spider?

01:37:58.994 --> 01:38:01.419
They took him.
The Blue Colonel took him.

01:38:14.619 --> 01:38:15.639
Take him.

01:38:36.549 --> 01:38:38.789
- Be calm.
- No fear.

01:38:40.229 --> 01:38:41.229
No fear.

01:38:49.039 --> 01:38:50.804
Jake Sully.

01:38:51.428 --> 01:38:53.199
Take the girls and you go now.

01:38:53.399 --> 01:38:56.519
- I will not go without you.
- No. They got Spider.

01:38:56.519 --> 01:38:59.120
There's nothing holding them back.
You've seen what they can do.

01:38:59.744 --> 01:39:04.239
- These people will die.
- You cannot ask this, husband.

01:39:04.239 --> 01:39:05.454
I can not.

01:39:06.878 --> 01:39:07.939
This is the only way.

01:39:09.333 --> 01:39:10.373
- Jake Sully!

01:39:11.009 --> 01:39:12.470
Show yourself.

01:39:12.494 --> 01:39:14.449
- You gotta go.
You gotta go right now.

01:39:14.729 --> 01:39:17.929
Take your sister, go and hide.
Go.

01:39:20.329 --> 01:39:23.345
If you stay, I stay.
I will kill many.

01:39:23.369 --> 01:39:27.369
Whatever happens, do not raise that bow.
You swear to me.

01:39:30.569 --> 01:39:33.262
I know he's here. Give him to me.

01:39:33.586 --> 01:39:34.969
He's Metkayina.

01:39:35.369 --> 01:39:38.369
He's one of us.
He's one of us!

01:39:39.409 --> 01:39:40.512
Burn something.

01:39:40.936 --> 01:39:44.387
- Dragon 2-4, lay down some incendiary
on the center village.

01:39:44.411 --> 01:39:45.969
- Copy. Switching incendiaries.

01:40:02.339 --> 01:40:06.839
- I want Jake Sully.
- Stop. Stop. No. No.

01:40:06.839 --> 01:40:09.059
Hold your fire.
Hold your fire. Stop.

01:40:10.519 --> 01:40:13.359
- Hold fire.
- Copy. Breaking off.

01:40:16.359 --> 01:40:18.159
This is my path, brother

01:40:26.035 --> 01:40:28.335
(Hissing)

01:40:36.209 --> 01:40:38.769
- Colonel.
- Corporal,

01:40:40.209 --> 01:40:42.929
Take me. You leave my family
and these people alone.

01:40:43.729 --> 01:40:47.169
Not good enough. Gonna need the missus too.

01:40:51.649 --> 01:40:52.970
- You get me.

01:40:52.994 --> 01:40:56.319
- Both of you or I hammer this place flat.

01:40:57.203 --> 01:40:59.099
Pregnant ladies, kids.

01:40:59.739 --> 01:41:02.595
I'll blow grandma's skinny shit
through the back of the hooch

01:41:02.619 --> 01:41:04.095
because I just don't care.

01:41:04.119 --> 01:41:07.099
And my pals here, well, they're just dying

01:41:07.199 --> 01:41:09.879
to waste everybody and take some scalps.

01:41:20.359 --> 01:41:22.359
(Collective hissing)

01:41:26.829 --> 01:41:29.629
Really? We doing this?

01:41:30.869 --> 01:41:34.549
When I drop my arm,
you and your new girlfriend die.

01:41:35.188 --> 01:41:39.189
- You in particular die a lot.
- I die, everybody here dies.

01:41:39.989 --> 01:41:43.829
Maybe. I think you can get some of us,
but not all of us.

01:41:44.149 --> 01:41:45.512
Maybe bum rush you.

01:41:45.536 --> 01:41:48.429
And your gunships hesitate
because we all look the same.

01:41:48.453 --> 01:41:51.129
And then when you're begging for your life,

01:41:53.609 --> 01:41:55.711
I'll scalp you.

01:41:55.935 --> 01:41:58.020
Well, damn, Corporal.

01:41:58.244 --> 01:42:01.845
I don't know if you're smart.
Or just shit nuts.

01:42:01.869 --> 01:42:04.089
You never struck me as all that smart.

01:42:05.129 --> 01:42:07.720
I need your word.
Marine to marine.

01:42:07.744 --> 01:42:11.179
Safety for these people.

01:42:11.603 --> 01:42:13.699
Burn them all,
Quaritch.

01:42:23.219 --> 01:42:24.712
- Do we have a deal?

01:42:29.513 --> 01:42:30.512
- Done.

01:42:30.536 --> 01:42:33.139
Want a pinky swear?

01:42:43.269 --> 01:42:44.349
- Take him.

01:42:45.795 --> 01:42:46.915
- Turn around.

01:42:52.909 --> 01:42:53.909
Move.

01:43:12.999 --> 01:43:15.062
Let's go. Come on.

01:43:15.086 --> 01:43:17.059
Another time then,
Mrs. Sully.

01:43:17.060 --> 01:43:18.060
(Hissing)

01:43:20.919 --> 01:43:22.359
- (Hissing)
- Saddle up.

01:44:05.859 --> 01:44:06.954
What do we got?

01:44:06.978 --> 01:44:08.512
- Ma'am, we have a big incursion.

01:44:08.536 --> 01:44:10.512
- Banshee riders inbound.
- I see that.

01:44:10.536 --> 01:44:13.059
- So light them up.
- I can't, Ma'am. Weapons locked out.

01:44:13.259 --> 01:44:14.920
They all have IFF badges.

01:44:16.044 --> 01:44:18.304
- Expand it
- Echo 1-6. And set the target

01:45:07.679 --> 01:45:09.599
All right. All right. Hold him there.

01:45:09.925 --> 01:45:10.925
- Easy! Easy!

01:45:11.849 --> 01:45:14.889
- Let's go.
- Jake!

01:45:14.969 --> 01:45:16.762
- Grab him.
Let's go. Move.

01:45:16.786 --> 01:45:18.129
- Jake!
- Bring him in.

01:45:18.629 --> 01:45:19.669
- Jake!

01:45:23.209 --> 01:45:24.269
Jake!

01:45:41.539 --> 01:45:46.579
Mission accomplished, General.
Jake Sully, Toruk Makto himself.

01:46:01.749 --> 01:46:03.687
It's not enough for you to hand out guns.

01:46:04.311 --> 01:46:08.829
You've got to bring hostiles
inside the perimeter.

01:46:09.549 --> 01:46:11.629
Not hostiles.
Allies.

01:46:12.709 --> 01:46:13.745
General Ardmore,

01:46:13.869 --> 01:46:17.309
I'd like you to meet Varang,
Tsahìk of the Mangkwan.

01:46:20.589 --> 01:46:22.887
Let me make this very
clear, Colonel Cochise.

01:46:22.911 --> 01:46:27.639
I want every one of these savages
escorted off my my base asap.

01:46:28.199 --> 01:46:30.199
Including your little missy over here.

01:46:36.759 --> 01:46:38.359
Don't be a jackass, General.

01:46:40.439 --> 01:46:41.439
Take the win.

01:46:43.799 --> 01:46:46.599
We got him, people. Huh?
- (Crowd cheering)

01:46:49.159 --> 01:46:50.199
End of an era.

01:47:08.567 --> 01:47:09.567
- Tsahìk

01:47:12.321 --> 01:47:13.321
- Let's go.

01:47:38.859 --> 01:47:42.059
Just feel this a little bit.. Hold still...

01:47:42.658 --> 01:47:44.338
- (Screaming in pain)

01:47:44.917 --> 01:47:46.197
- Almost there..

01:47:47.669 --> 01:47:49.349
- Good. Hold it there.

01:47:51.737 --> 01:47:52.737
- (Snarling)

01:47:54.677 --> 01:47:55.977
Payakan!

01:47:57.295 --> 01:47:58.895
(Ilu vocalizing)

01:47:59.204 --> 01:48:00.204
- Payakan!

01:48:07.029 --> 01:48:09.899
The people say the sea washes you clean.

01:48:10.354 --> 01:48:11.354
Payakan!

01:48:14.939 --> 01:48:16.120
- It's Lo'ak.
- It's him.

01:48:16.144 --> 01:48:17.299
- Lo'ak!
- It's him!

01:48:17.339 --> 01:48:19.272
- Lo'ak!
- Skxawng! Over here!

01:48:19.340 --> 01:48:20.260
-  Lo'ak!
- Lo'ak!

01:48:20.493 --> 01:48:21.493
- Tsireya!

01:48:25.419 --> 01:48:29.099
They also say if you see
the deep ones, the tsyong..

01:48:32.379 --> 01:48:34.219
They're spirits sent to judge you.

01:48:46.929 --> 01:48:47.729
- Tsyong!

01:48:47.860 --> 01:48:48.900
- Go, go, go!

01:50:04.098 --> 01:50:05.098
Lo'ak?

01:50:05.282 --> 01:50:06.282
Lo'ak? Lo'ak?

01:50:06.916 --> 01:50:07.916
Lo'ak!

01:50:12.449 --> 01:50:13.449
Tsireya

01:50:19.059 --> 01:50:22.499
- Thank you, Great Mother.
- Come on. Let him breathe.

01:50:22.499 --> 01:50:23.519
- Let him go.

01:50:27.779 --> 01:50:29.299
Can't believe you guys came after me.

01:50:30.659 --> 01:50:32.259
My friend's path is my path.

01:50:36.659 --> 01:50:38.345
Is this your sister?
- Yes.

01:50:39.169 --> 01:50:40.679
What about Payakan?

01:50:40.739 --> 01:50:43.709
- Does she hear him?
- He is close. He is coming now.

01:50:50.829 --> 01:50:54.149
- So what have you got?
- This mycelium

01:50:54.249 --> 01:50:55.454
that's living inside his body.

01:50:55.578 --> 01:50:57.162
- Wait. There's something
living inside of him?

01:50:57.186 --> 01:50:58.637
- Yes. It's an endosymbiont.

01:50:58.661 --> 01:51:00.429
Somehow
moderating the ion exchange.

01:51:00.453 --> 01:51:02.345
- Stop. I don't need to know how it works.

01:51:02.369 --> 01:51:04.129
I just need to know
if we can duplicate it

01:51:10.969 --> 01:51:12.489
Let me out of here, you jerk offs!

01:51:16.249 --> 01:51:19.449
- I told those rubber glove pukes
to lay off you for a while.

01:51:19.929 --> 01:51:24.389
- Where's Jake?
- He's locked up where he belongs. Here...

01:51:25.815 --> 01:51:27.448
I brought you a burger.

01:51:27.490 --> 01:51:28.065
(SMACK)

01:51:28.089 --> 01:51:30.969
- Better not hurt him.
- He's not part of your life anymore.

01:51:32.329 --> 01:51:35.939
You're with me now.
I'm your father.

01:51:36.419 --> 01:51:38.304
- My father's dead.

01:51:38.328 --> 01:51:42.054
You're just some.. made up thing they
gave his memories to.

01:51:42.078 --> 01:51:43.779
- No, no, no.

01:51:44.179 --> 01:51:47.779
I'm still me. I checked.
Yeah, look.

01:51:49.059 --> 01:51:52.339
- Colonel Miles Quaritch.
- Deceased.

01:51:57.779 --> 01:51:59.595
- You know, we didn't get
a chance to talk too much

01:51:59.619 --> 01:52:04.009
when we were out in the bush together,
But, uh.. I gotta thank you.

01:52:04.409 --> 01:52:07.949
I mean, you hauled me out of a sunken ship.

01:52:08.849 --> 01:52:10.179
You saved my life.

01:52:10.203 --> 01:52:13.245
- Yeah, sure wish I hadn't done that.

01:52:14.369 --> 01:52:15.889
- Maybe that's true.

01:52:17.248 --> 01:52:20.049
Maybe deep down, it isn't.
Either way,

01:52:21.249 --> 01:52:25.109
I owe you.
And I gotta tell you that, uh..

01:52:27.109 --> 01:52:29.699
Man, I'm proud of you.

01:52:31.099 --> 01:52:32.354
You're an amazing kid.

01:52:32.378 --> 01:52:37.220
You got guts, smarts, and,

01:52:37.244 --> 01:52:38.939
Son, you got the heart of a lion

01:52:40.986 --> 01:52:42.779
I see myself in you.

01:52:42.879 --> 01:52:45.720
Oh, yeah.

01:52:45.744 --> 01:52:48.595
I'll tell you who
I really see in you,

01:52:48.619 --> 01:52:49.739
and that's your mother.

01:52:51.899 --> 01:52:54.489
She was.. ferocious.

01:52:56.009 --> 01:52:59.889
Tough to live with, but.. I loved her.

01:53:00.389 --> 01:53:02.729
And, man, did she love you.

01:53:05.769 --> 01:53:07.729
Hardest thing she ever
did was climbing aboard

01:53:07.753 --> 01:53:08.848
that gunship that day,

01:53:09.209 --> 01:53:12.889
going into battle,
leaving her little baby behind.

01:53:16.009 --> 01:53:18.009
Your mom died a hero, son.

01:53:20.259 --> 01:53:21.619
You got that in you, too?

01:53:24.899 --> 01:53:27.912
Anyway, I didn't come down here
to take a trip down memory lane.

01:53:27.936 --> 01:53:29.970
I just came by to tell you
that I'm here for you.

01:53:31.294 --> 01:53:33.739
If.. you need me..

01:53:35.939 --> 01:53:39.519
I'm here for you.

01:53:41.139 --> 01:53:42.199
- Can I keep it?

01:53:53.229 --> 01:53:54.469
- Eat something. Will you?

01:54:05.869 --> 01:54:06.949
- Brother!

01:54:14.119 --> 01:54:15.559
I see you, brother.

01:54:21.879 --> 01:54:23.639
What is it?
What's wrong?

01:54:29.159 --> 01:54:30.919
Didn't you find your birth clan?

01:54:59.189 --> 01:55:01.054
Tulkun are already coming in,

01:55:01.078 --> 01:55:02.749
but the aggregation

01:55:02.849 --> 01:55:04.129
doesn't peak until the eclipse,

01:55:04.453 --> 01:55:06.189
which is the day after tomorrow.

01:55:06.669 --> 01:55:08.095
And that's when we hit them.

01:55:08.119 --> 01:55:09.789
- No, no, hold on.

01:55:10.109 --> 01:55:12.554
No. You're talking about
wholesale slaughter.

01:55:12.578 --> 01:55:15.387
Hundreds killed.
Entire pods just wiped out.

01:55:15.511 --> 01:55:18.887
- That's the beauty of the idea.
We'll fill a year's quota in just one day.

01:55:18.911 --> 01:55:21.389
- These are intelligent, soulful beings.

01:55:21.629 --> 01:55:24.749
- Who are you?
- Ian - Ian Garvin,

01:55:25.069 --> 01:55:28.639
Marine biologist.
These - These creatures,

01:55:29.139 --> 01:55:30.845
They have culture, they have music.

01:55:30.869 --> 01:55:32.959
They have names for each other.
This is organized.

01:55:33.059 --> 01:55:35.429
This aggregation is - is deliberate.

01:55:35.453 --> 01:55:36.679
It's a spiritual gathering.

01:55:36.679 --> 01:55:39.845
- Get off your high horse, Garvin.
We all made our deals.

01:55:39.869 --> 01:55:42.429
- No, I did not sign up for this!

01:55:42.453 --> 01:55:43.979
- Dr. Garvin. Dr. Garvin.
Thank you.

01:55:44.379 --> 01:55:45.662
Your protest has been noted.

01:55:45.886 --> 01:55:47.099
- Oh, it's been noted?
- Yes.

01:55:48.199 --> 01:55:49.929
- Sub teams and fast boats,

01:55:49.953 --> 01:55:52.029
you guys will form a cordon.

01:55:52.659 --> 01:55:54.387
You drive the family groups in here

01:55:54.411 --> 01:55:57.539
to where it forms a natural
choke point against the islands.

01:56:08.179 --> 01:56:09.539
I can't believe we got him.

01:56:11.219 --> 01:56:14.979
- Hey. Make a hole.
- Open up

01:56:16.659 --> 01:56:17.659
- Weapon, Sir.

01:56:26.909 --> 01:56:28.029
- End of the line, Jake.

01:56:29.789 --> 01:56:31.229
06:00.
Tomorrow.

01:56:34.029 --> 01:56:37.469
Varang wants your heart,
but I'm going old school.

01:56:38.029 --> 01:56:43.512
Firing squad.
Selfridge says it's a better optic.

01:56:43.536 --> 01:56:45.879
- Yeah. Will you be a good dog for the suits?

01:56:48.439 --> 01:56:49.639
- This isn't about them.

01:56:53.479 --> 01:56:56.179
This is about me and you.

01:56:56.203 --> 01:56:58.929
About a Marine that betrayed my trust.

01:56:58.953 --> 01:57:01.319
About the men and women I lost.

01:57:07.559 --> 01:57:10.137
- Dead man's memories,

01:57:11.961 --> 01:57:18.599
Miles Quaritch is gone.
You're free.

01:57:18.719 --> 01:57:20.720
And there is a world out there.

01:57:20.744 --> 01:57:24.079
There's things that those
suits will never understand.

01:57:26.135 --> 01:57:28.715
The Na'vi call it kame..

01:57:28.882 --> 01:57:29.882
To See

01:57:41.159 --> 01:57:42.599
And See this world.

01:57:45.999 --> 01:57:47.079
See yourself.

01:57:51.519 --> 01:57:55.119
- I'll see you. At 06:00

01:58:51.139 --> 01:58:52.512
Last time I got two.

01:58:52.536 --> 01:58:55.229
But they were the
ugliest ones in the village.

01:59:13.949 --> 01:59:17.069
- Open. Watch it.
- Hands on the wall.

01:59:17.759 --> 01:59:18.839
Hands on the wall.

01:59:23.199 --> 01:59:24.959
- All right, we're good. Close it.

01:59:37.199 --> 01:59:39.079
It's nothing. Just one of Quaritch's scouts.

02:00:09.839 --> 02:00:10.859
Watch for me.

02:00:32.819 --> 02:00:35.012
Okay. You've got a PHD.

02:00:35.036 --> 02:00:36.989
How hard can it be?

02:00:57.389 --> 02:00:58.469
Check this out.

02:01:02.839 --> 02:01:03.859
What's up, cutie?

02:01:03.905 --> 02:01:04.905
- (SNARLS)

02:01:06.999 --> 02:01:08.059
She wants me.

02:01:08.235 --> 02:01:09.435
- Naaaah
- What?

02:01:16.925 --> 02:01:18.605
- Quaritch.
- Quaritch.

02:01:21.879 --> 02:01:23.939
We are the fire. Mangkwan!

02:01:31.520 --> 02:01:33.520
- (Cheering)

02:01:34.112 --> 02:01:35.112
- (Hissing)

02:01:37.569 --> 02:01:41.489
Make no sound, witch.
Where is Jake Sully?

02:01:42.089 --> 02:01:44.969
- The wife, loyal to her man.

02:01:45.062 --> 02:01:46.422
- Speak or I cut.

02:01:50.729 --> 02:01:54.049
Where? I will not ask again.

02:01:55.195 --> 02:01:56.395
- (Hissing)

02:01:57.529 --> 02:02:00.969
No, wait, wait.
Past the camp.

02:02:02.609 --> 02:02:05.249
A cage for an animal..
- Take me there.

02:02:06.529 --> 02:02:08.849
- Move. Which way?
- Hey, sugar,

02:02:12.775 --> 02:02:13.305
- (Hissing)

02:02:13.329 --> 02:02:14.349
Join the party.

02:02:15.428 --> 02:02:16.428
- (HISSING)

02:02:27.099 --> 02:02:29.419
- Get after her.
- I want her heart!

02:02:43.829 --> 02:02:44.869
Go, Go, Go

02:03:01.110 --> 02:03:02.150
- Take cover!

02:03:03.309 --> 02:03:04.669
- Clear the area!

02:03:04.979 --> 02:03:06.679
- (Shouting)

02:03:15.662 --> 02:03:16.662
Jake!

02:03:19.489 --> 02:03:21.120
- General.
- Not now.

02:03:21.144 --> 02:03:23.189
- I have a situation.
- No, I have a situation.

02:03:23.689 --> 02:03:26.729
The kid is loose
and I need him back, alive.

02:03:36.459 --> 02:03:37.479
Light her up.

02:04:21.540 --> 02:04:22.540
- Hey!

02:04:22.863 --> 02:04:23.863
Woah!

02:04:23.979 --> 02:04:26.313
- Hey! Hey! Woah, hey!
- Stop! Stop!

02:04:29.436 --> 02:04:33.004
Out of the way, guys.
Move it, move it.

02:04:33.128 --> 02:04:34.489
Fire. Hit him, hit him, hit him.

02:04:36.909 --> 02:04:38.349
Out of the way, guys.

02:04:45.949 --> 02:04:46.949
Weigh it down...

02:04:49.864 --> 02:04:52.164
- (Shouting)

02:04:54.036 --> 02:04:55.119
Go. Jake,

02:04:58.999 --> 02:04:59.999
Light him up.

02:05:03.639 --> 02:05:04.759
Reverse..

02:05:08.439 --> 02:05:09.479
Got you.

02:05:12.326 --> 02:05:14.226
- (Shouting)

02:05:14.919 --> 02:05:16.029
- Aim for the cameras!

02:05:16.153 --> 02:05:17.853
Okay, stay with me..

02:05:25.889 --> 02:05:27.049
Stay with me.

02:05:32.529 --> 02:05:34.849
What am I doing?
What am I doing?

02:05:57.259 --> 02:05:59.019
Is my protest noted now, fuckers?

02:06:08.129 --> 02:06:11.089
Jake, this way.

02:06:11.349 --> 02:06:13.269
- No, no, this way. This way.
- Okay.

02:06:16.709 --> 02:06:18.309
Ian Garvin, Marine bio.

02:06:19.309 --> 02:06:20.320
- Come on.

02:06:20.344 --> 02:06:23.369
- Hey. I gotta say I'm a real big
fan of everything you've done.

02:06:23.669 --> 02:06:25.595
I'm more than a little
awe inspired right now.

02:06:25.619 --> 02:06:26.869
- The way that you..
- Shut up.

02:06:28.549 --> 02:06:32.229
- What's the plan?
- This is as far as I got.

02:06:32.949 --> 02:06:35.719
What, there's no plan.
Just Neytiri.

02:06:36.119 --> 02:06:37.159
Come on.

02:06:41.959 --> 02:06:43.139
Go, go, go.

02:06:55.879 --> 02:06:57.554
Why are you doing this?

02:06:58.078 --> 02:07:02.139
- There's going to be a massive
tulkun hunt the day after tomorrow.

02:07:03.099 --> 02:07:06.059
They're going to hit them
with every ship they've got.

02:07:06.059 --> 02:07:07.354
- Calf communion.

02:07:09.278 --> 02:07:11.104
- You've got to stop them.

02:07:11.128 --> 02:07:14.339
- You're the only one who can.
- Come on.

02:07:24.459 --> 02:07:26.079
Sa'ata, shhh...

02:07:29.699 --> 02:07:30.739
Let's go.

02:07:37.282 --> 02:07:38.282
Move, move!

02:07:39.739 --> 02:07:42.779
Go, now. Go, go!

02:07:48.979 --> 02:07:51.949
Damn it.
Go! Get out of here!

02:07:59.869 --> 02:08:02.470
Lima 1:6. There's a subject
pinned down behind a vehicle.

02:08:02.494 --> 02:08:03.649
Said Sully's pinned down.

02:08:03.849 --> 02:08:05.887
- Switch missiles, take him out.

02:08:05.911 --> 02:08:07.469
- Copy. Switching missiles.

02:08:09.069 --> 02:08:10.189
Hey. Remember me?

02:08:12.669 --> 02:08:15.629
That's right, pendejos!
Yeah! I don't need this shit.

02:08:17.399 --> 02:08:19.559
What are you gonna do?
You gonna shoot me?

02:08:21.879 --> 02:08:23.470
The kids with him?
The air breather.

02:08:23.494 --> 02:08:25.259
- He's blocking my shot.
- Move, move, move.

02:08:26.199 --> 02:08:27.799
Don't shoot. Tell him not to shoot.

02:08:28.999 --> 02:08:31.429
Lima 1-6. Blue 1. Hold your fire.

02:08:31.453 --> 02:08:32.970
Keep visual on him.

02:08:32.994 --> 02:08:35.845
1-6, hold your fire. Get more assets in
that position.

02:08:35.869 --> 02:08:37.970
Yeah. You're not gonna shoot me. You know
why?

02:08:37.994 --> 02:08:41.159
Because you can't. Know what you can do though?

02:08:41.399 --> 02:08:44.569
You can kiss my ass. Yeah!
Come on, Jake. Go.

02:08:45.069 --> 02:08:48.209
What are you doing?
Come on. Go, go. Come on.

02:08:49.729 --> 02:08:50.612
- He's moving west.

02:08:50.636 --> 02:08:53.269
Maintain a target lock.
The shot is not clear.

02:08:54.529 --> 02:08:55.649
- Hey, stay on me.

02:09:01.969 --> 02:09:03.137
Stay close to me.

02:09:03.161 --> 02:09:04.809
I'm not gonna play this game.

02:09:05.109 --> 02:09:06.387
Lima 1-6, take your shot.

02:09:06.411 --> 02:09:08.054
- No, no, don't shoot.

02:09:08.078 --> 02:09:09.079
- Get him out of here.

02:09:09.159 --> 02:09:10.595
Hold your fire.

02:09:10.919 --> 02:09:12.219
Go, go, go!

02:09:12.299 --> 02:09:15.599
Lima 1-6, you are cleared hot.
Weapons free.

02:09:15.599 --> 02:09:17.499
Unable. I lost visual.
Coming around.

02:09:19.739 --> 02:09:21.254
- He's coming back around.
- This way!

02:09:21.278 --> 02:09:23.939
This is Blue 1, check your fire.

02:09:24.239 --> 02:09:26.179
- Lima 1-6, you are cleared hot.

02:09:26.203 --> 02:09:27.979
- 1-6 in hot.

02:09:34.584 --> 02:09:35.584
- Down!

02:09:44.985 --> 02:09:45.985
- Ma Jake!

02:09:47.039 --> 02:09:49.304
- Neytiri!

02:09:49.328 --> 02:09:53.337
- Baby. I don't know whether
to kiss you or yell at you.

02:09:53.361 --> 02:09:54.519
- You waste time.

02:09:55.199 --> 02:09:56.379
Come on, let's go.

02:09:58.779 --> 02:09:59.779
- Let's go

02:10:15.769 --> 02:10:16.969
Land, anywhere.

02:10:39.779 --> 02:10:41.762
I gotta take a huge leak.

02:10:42.586 --> 02:10:45.045
You guys landed just in time.

02:10:45.969 --> 02:10:47.059
- What is it?

02:10:47.459 --> 02:10:48.579
Why are we stopping?

02:10:54.269 --> 02:10:57.389
They didn't even put a fly in this thing.
That's just dumb.

02:10:58.669 --> 02:11:01.595
Good idea. Drink first,
then piss in the stream.

02:11:01.619 --> 02:11:05.229
- What is it Jake?
- I was wrong.

02:11:06.429 --> 02:11:07.869
We can't protect him.

02:11:09.469 --> 02:11:12.109
I gotta take this stuff off.. It's itchy as Hell.

02:11:13.149 --> 02:11:16.129
Quaritch has this woman..
He can find us wherever we go..

02:11:18.453 --> 02:11:19.679
They will get him.

02:11:19.703 --> 02:11:21.579
They will study him.

02:11:22.219 --> 02:11:24.379
And when humans can breathe our air,

02:11:26.459 --> 02:11:29.220
then they will spread across this world

02:11:29.244 --> 02:11:32.429
and they will destroy the
forests, the oceans, everything.

02:11:32.453 --> 02:11:33.739
Just like on Earth.

02:11:34.779 --> 02:11:37.419
Then the Na'vi people will be gone.

02:11:38.539 --> 02:11:40.219
The tulkun will be gone.

02:11:41.669 --> 02:11:44.469
And I can't let that happen.

02:11:45.109 --> 02:11:46.709
- Are you hungry? I'm starving.

02:11:53.429 --> 02:11:54.509
You were right.

02:11:59.829 --> 02:12:00.949
This has to be done.

02:12:03.269 --> 02:12:04.679
- Jake...

02:12:06.237 --> 02:12:08.037
He saved your life..

02:12:19.759 --> 02:12:21.119
This is the only way.

02:12:34.009 --> 02:12:37.529
Spider. Come here.

02:12:45.209 --> 02:12:46.209
- What's going on?

02:12:49.449 --> 02:12:52.409
What is it?
- Just come with me.

02:12:55.369 --> 02:12:56.429
Come on, let's go.

02:13:06.079 --> 02:13:07.620
Hey, stop for a second.
I gotta take a leak.

02:13:07.744 --> 02:13:09.139
- Just stay close.

02:13:18.339 --> 02:13:20.899
- Where are we going?
- Be quiet.

02:13:36.909 --> 02:13:38.669
So is this like, a talk?

02:13:51.719 --> 02:13:53.559
Come here. Come on. Come on.

02:13:57.719 --> 02:14:00.919
This will work.
Kneel.

02:14:02.119 --> 02:14:03.762
Kneel.
- No.

02:14:03.786 --> 02:14:04.839
- Kneel down.

02:14:05.959 --> 02:14:08.999
- Please. Jake. Please, stop.

02:14:09.959 --> 02:14:11.959
- Eyes front. Don't move.

02:14:12.599 --> 02:14:15.079
- Please, you don't have to do this.

02:14:17.399 --> 02:14:18.404
Please.

02:14:19.028 --> 02:14:21.299
- Great Mother, are you here?

02:14:22.839 --> 02:14:24.137
- You don't have to do this.

02:14:24.161 --> 02:14:26.799
- Guide my hand.
- Please don't do this.

02:14:27.299 --> 02:14:30.478
- Give me strength.
- Just stop. Please. Stop.

02:14:30.978 --> 02:14:31.987
Please.

02:14:32.311 --> 02:14:36.819
- Don't look at me. Don't look at me.
- Please!

02:14:37.760 --> 02:14:39.040
Forgive me, son.

02:14:39.219 --> 02:14:42.220
- I'll be good.
- May your spirit go to Eywa.

02:14:42.244 --> 02:14:44.929
- I promise.
- May your body return to the forest.

02:14:47.009 --> 02:14:49.169
- Please, Dad.
- To preserve the great balance.

02:14:50.209 --> 02:14:52.049
May the ancestors welcome you.

02:14:52.493 --> 02:14:55.993
- (Sobbing)

02:15:06.139 --> 02:15:07.979
- Please.

02:15:09.179 --> 02:15:11.054
- May the ancestors hold you.

02:15:11.078 --> 02:15:12.929
May they sing your song.

02:15:12.953 --> 02:15:16.299
- I know I have to go to Eywa now.

02:15:18.219 --> 02:15:20.470
It's okay.

02:15:20.494 --> 02:15:21.519
But..

02:15:22.348 --> 02:15:23.348
Do you..

02:15:24.512 --> 02:15:26.192
Do you still love me?

02:15:28.139 --> 02:15:29.179
With all my heart.

02:16:13.389 --> 02:16:14.389
- Ma Jake?

02:16:14.926 --> 02:16:16.126
Ma Jake!

02:16:26.629 --> 02:16:27.629
I See you.

02:16:36.089 --> 02:16:38.568
- Whatever happens, it won't be .. this way.

02:16:40.809 --> 02:16:42.649
- Then we will find another way.

02:16:59.298 --> 02:17:04.138
My dad knew in his heart
there was only ever one path

02:17:11.618 --> 02:17:15.128
No matter how you imagine
yourself. As a father,

02:17:15.928 --> 02:17:18.808
As a husband. Sooner or later,

02:17:19.688 --> 02:17:20.728
you're back on it.

02:17:40.699 --> 02:17:41.779
- Hello, old friend.

02:17:44.659 --> 02:17:46.419
Toruk loved my father.

02:17:49.459 --> 02:17:51.059
He knew they were greater together.

02:17:52.339 --> 02:17:55.139
That when they flew,
there would be blood.

02:17:59.139 --> 02:18:00.219
- He is coming.

02:18:24.764 --> 02:18:26.364
- Toruk Makto!

02:18:29.058 --> 02:18:30.015
- No, no, no..

02:18:30.039 --> 02:18:32.359
Just, please.. Stand.

02:18:33.079 --> 02:18:34.599
Stand up. Please,

02:18:35.799 --> 02:18:36.887
Baby.
- Jake.

02:18:37.211 --> 02:18:40.439
Please. It's okay.
It's okay.

02:18:43.159 --> 02:18:46.639
Go now to all the clans
within the day's ride and tell them

02:18:50.119 --> 02:18:52.319
Tell them Toruk Makto calls to them.

02:18:54.679 --> 02:18:58.229
You tell them.. The day has come.

02:19:39.079 --> 02:19:42.839
And so it came to pass
that Toruk Makto returned.

02:19:43.479 --> 02:19:46.039
My father united the clans once again.

02:19:47.448 --> 02:19:49.070
He made the great speeches.

02:19:49.494 --> 02:19:53.054
Many arrows together, cannot be broken.

02:19:55.278 --> 02:19:56.808
We cannot be broken!

02:19:56.878 --> 02:20:01.478
(Cheering)

02:20:04.729 --> 02:20:06.969
But he knew that it wasn't enough.

02:20:25.540 --> 02:20:28.340
Great Matriarch, wise elders,

02:20:30.100 --> 02:20:33.380
the Sky People are coming. Here today,

02:20:34.180 --> 02:20:37.260
Right now, to kill our Tulkun families.

02:20:38.610 --> 02:20:41.570
I beg you, Fight with us.

02:20:50.290 --> 02:20:53.489
- She says we respect Toruk Makto,

02:20:53.970 --> 02:20:55.570
but our ways are ancient.

02:21:00.130 --> 02:21:03.790
We believe that killing
will only bring more killing

02:21:04.510 --> 02:21:07.230
in an endless, expanding spiral.

02:21:09.870 --> 02:21:12.638
- Hear my words.

02:21:12.662 --> 02:21:15.846
The Sky People will never stop.

02:21:15.870 --> 02:21:19.154
Not until the last of the tulkun is hunted.

02:21:25.750 --> 02:21:27.050
- Lo'ak!

02:21:40.470 --> 02:21:42.846
- Stop. Stop.
- Lo'ak, what are you doing?

02:21:42.870 --> 02:21:45.305
Alright, you can't be here.
- Dad, wait.

02:21:45.329 --> 02:21:47.270
I am brother of Tulkun.

02:21:47.750 --> 02:21:50.950
- I have a right to speak.
- Lo'ak speaks the truth.

02:21:51.030 --> 02:21:53.270
- You must listen.
- Tsireya

02:21:58.420 --> 02:22:03.700
She says his brother is outcast.
You have no standing here.

02:22:06.020 --> 02:22:09.780
- If he is outcast, then I am outcast.

02:22:10.980 --> 02:22:14.060
- And I am outcast.
- Daughter, silence!

02:22:14.160 --> 02:22:17.540
No! You will never see me again.

02:22:19.860 --> 02:22:23.020
- And I and my brother are outcast.
- Aonung!

02:22:23.520 --> 02:22:27.070
- And we are also outcast.

02:22:39.390 --> 02:22:42.190
- She says.. You may speak.

02:22:46.350 --> 02:22:51.221
- Hear my words. My brother returned
to his birth clan to defend them.

02:22:51.745 --> 02:22:55.471
But his clan was wiped out
by the demon ships.

02:22:55.495 --> 02:22:59.888
Only Ta'nok survived.. Because
she fought back!

02:22:59.912 --> 02:23:01.710
Come forward.

02:23:29.275 --> 02:23:30.975
Ta'nok says..

02:23:31.000 --> 02:23:36.120
I speak for the dead mothers
and the dead calves.

02:23:41.730 --> 02:23:43.055
I speak for my people.

02:23:43.079 --> 02:23:45.050
And all our songs..

02:23:47.254 --> 02:23:48.254
Gone...

02:23:49.541 --> 02:23:50.541
Forever.

02:23:56.210 --> 02:24:00.290
She says I am the last.
The blind witness to our end.

02:24:06.700 --> 02:24:09.260
Ta'nok says the Tulkun way must change.

02:24:10.060 --> 02:24:11.740
Payakan shows our path.

02:24:19.740 --> 02:24:21.920
We must fight.

02:24:21.952 --> 02:24:23.632
- We must fight!

02:24:41.110 --> 02:24:43.990
- What did she say?
- They will decide.

02:24:45.990 --> 02:24:49.630
Look at all of this.
I mean, there's hundreds of them.

02:24:50.630 --> 02:24:54.170
And look at all these old ones.
And old is good.

02:24:54.790 --> 02:24:58.680
They never stop growing.
Which means more Amrita

02:24:59.480 --> 02:25:04.096
And look at this mama.
She must be 100 meters.

02:25:04.420 --> 02:25:06.620
- You're briefing without me.

02:25:07.280 --> 02:25:09.055
An oversight, I assume.

02:25:09.279 --> 02:25:11.138
- No, this is not an oversight.

02:25:11.162 --> 02:25:14.471
After your fiasco with Sully.
You're done, Colonel.

02:25:14.495 --> 02:25:17.520
You're confined to base
pending an investigation.

02:25:18.080 --> 02:25:20.138
- Negative on that.
I need to roll.

02:25:20.162 --> 02:25:23.430
Sully will be there, which means
that Spider will be there as well.

02:25:23.454 --> 02:25:26.096
- Don't look at him.
He's one step away from the brig himself.

02:25:26.120 --> 02:25:27.596
- Don't tell him not to look at me.

02:25:27.620 --> 02:25:29.221
- What are you gonna do, call Daddy?

02:25:29.245 --> 02:25:31.180
- You mean the chairman?
- That's enough.

02:25:33.260 --> 02:25:35.580
- I can still complete this mission.

02:25:36.060 --> 02:25:39.260
- Look at you.
You're a disgrace to your uniform.

02:25:39.500 --> 02:25:41.660
Assuming you remember what a uniform is.

02:25:43.020 --> 02:25:45.420
You're grounded, Colonel, permanently.

02:26:02.630 --> 02:26:03.670
Why are you here, girl?

02:26:06.230 --> 02:26:07.510
- To pray, Tsahìk.

02:26:12.630 --> 02:26:13.670
- No, child.

02:26:17.600 --> 02:26:19.200
Why did you come to us?

02:26:22.720 --> 02:26:28.080
Perhaps it was for this moment

02:26:28.104 --> 02:26:32.520
only a chosen one may
call upon the Warrior Mother..

02:26:35.860 --> 02:26:37.927
- (Groaning in pain)
- Tsahìk..?

02:26:39.040 --> 02:26:42.200
- You're having contractions.
- I fear we will..

02:26:42.920 --> 02:26:44.440
We will not survive this.

02:26:49.640 --> 02:26:52.305
Kiri,

02:26:53.429 --> 02:26:55.205
hear my words.

02:26:55.829 --> 02:26:58.860
If there is something you can do..

02:27:00.260 --> 02:27:02.800
Then you must do it

02:27:06.200 --> 02:27:08.450
- You have a strong heart.

02:27:09.730 --> 02:27:10.730
- Here.

02:27:11.680 --> 02:27:13.360
- I'm riding with you?

02:27:13.410 --> 02:27:14.610
- No. I need you here.

02:27:17.090 --> 02:27:19.680
I can't do this unless I know
you kids are safe.

02:27:19.704 --> 02:27:21.680
You keep your post no matter what happens.

02:27:22.204 --> 02:27:23.810
You read me?

02:27:23.885 --> 02:27:25.485
- Lima Charlie, Sir.

02:27:31.970 --> 02:27:33.763
- If your father and I do not return,

02:27:33.787 --> 02:27:39.530
you take Spider and the girls and
you go as far and as fast as you can.

02:28:26.920 --> 02:28:27.920
Holy shit.

02:28:32.940 --> 02:28:35.471
General, this Flux is off the scale.

02:28:35.495 --> 02:28:37.846
- Keep a wide radius from that Flux Devil.

02:28:38.070 --> 02:28:39.600
That thing will rip your face off.

02:28:40.300 --> 02:28:41.900
- Roger. Gun runner coming right.

02:28:59.110 --> 02:29:01.670
Okay, boys, let's make some bank!

02:29:03.350 --> 02:29:05.110
Let's go. Let's do this.

02:29:16.280 --> 02:29:17.960
Sub team, get wet.

02:29:28.160 --> 02:29:30.480
Yeah, baby! (Laughs)
Let's do this!

02:29:40.400 --> 02:29:43.370
- See any hostiles?
- Negative. No movement.

02:29:43.850 --> 02:29:45.770
And the big guys
are just doing their thing.

02:29:48.730 --> 02:29:50.490
Fish in a barrel, Scoresby.

02:29:51.214 --> 02:29:52.414
- Hold

02:29:55.770 --> 02:29:58.250
Just hold. Hold, hold...

02:30:00.374 --> 02:30:01.374
- Hold...

02:30:11.540 --> 02:30:12.900
Hang on...

02:30:13.529 --> 02:30:14.969
There's no bulls..

02:30:15.719 --> 02:30:17.076
And no big females.

02:30:18.000 --> 02:30:19.180
- There's no elders.

02:30:22.020 --> 02:30:24.071
- Hold up, everybody.

02:30:24.295 --> 02:30:28.300
- Sir, I got a big signature.
Tulkun. Big ones.

02:30:29.300 --> 02:30:32.020
Lots of big ones.
- Multiple tulkun inbound.

02:30:44.990 --> 02:30:47.318
Scoresby, I thought you
told me they're not aggressive.

02:30:47.342 --> 02:30:49.910
- Well, they're not..

02:30:49.989 --> 02:30:50.989
Generally...

02:31:01.592 --> 02:31:03.040
- I've lost visual

02:31:32.960 --> 02:31:35.680
Dude, they're fighting! Yes! Yes!

02:31:51.604 --> 02:31:54.837
(Shouting)
(Alarms blaring)

02:31:58.841 --> 02:32:00.141
(Cheering)

02:32:00.378 --> 02:32:01.078
- NOW!

02:32:01.172 --> 02:32:02.172
- KÄ!

02:32:03.656 --> 02:32:04.856
- MAKTO KO!

02:32:06.864 --> 02:32:07.864
- Yeah!

02:32:15.975 --> 02:32:18.775
(War cries)

02:32:23.808 --> 02:32:24.808
(Yelling)

02:32:30.901 --> 02:32:31.901
- Watch it!

02:32:54.270 --> 02:32:56.910
Man your weapons. Open fire.

02:33:22.266 --> 02:33:23.946
Port side! Port side!

02:33:24.630 --> 02:33:25.630
(Yelling)

02:33:28.800 --> 02:33:29.410
Reload!

02:33:30.029 --> 02:33:31.029
- Watch out!

02:33:55.695 --> 02:33:57.215
(Muffled screaming)

02:34:04.100 --> 02:34:05.520
Yeah, Jake!

02:34:05.637 --> 02:34:06.637
- Bro, look!

02:34:18.451 --> 02:34:19.451
- Nice!

02:34:20.091 --> 02:34:20.491
Yeah!

02:34:35.182 --> 02:34:35.682
Jake!

02:34:40.152 --> 02:34:41.352
It's the Ash...

02:34:42.530 --> 02:34:46.410
Bogey's inbound. Banshee Riders.
Over a hundred. They're friendlies.

02:34:46.410 --> 02:34:47.963
They have IFF badges.

02:34:48.282 --> 02:34:49.263
- They're ours.

02:34:49.287 --> 02:34:51.471
- Thanks for getting Sully
out in the open, General.

02:34:51.495 --> 02:34:52.780
I'll take it from here.

02:34:53.740 --> 02:34:54.740
(War cry)

02:35:29.800 --> 02:35:31.080
They can't win.

02:35:32.166 --> 02:35:33.286
They're dying!

02:35:35.420 --> 02:35:38.140
- Woah- Kiri!
- Kiri!

02:35:38.339 --> 02:35:39.339
- Stop her!
- Kiri!

02:35:39.856 --> 02:35:40.856
Kiri, stop!

02:35:41.283 --> 02:35:42.283
Kiri, no- Stop stop stop!

02:35:42.570 --> 02:35:43.763
Get back to the shelter right now.

02:35:43.787 --> 02:35:44.796
It's not safe out here.

02:35:44.820 --> 02:35:46.388
I have to call to the Great Mother.

02:35:46.412 --> 02:35:47.846
If you connect underwater,
it'll kill you.

02:35:47.870 --> 02:35:50.138
- You can't do this. We have to go.

02:35:50.162 --> 02:35:52.570
- You can't be out here right now.
Go. Get back.

02:35:52.810 --> 02:35:54.050
Kiri wait, Kiri stop.

02:35:56.090 --> 02:35:57.790
- Kiri stop!
- Kiri!

02:35:58.199 --> 02:35:58.999
Kiri!

02:35:59.020 --> 02:36:00.020
- Kiri!

02:36:00.970 --> 02:36:04.010
- Come on!
- No, wait - Crap. Crap.

02:36:04.970 --> 02:36:06.590
Tuk. You stay back. I mean it.

02:36:06.662 --> 02:36:07.942
- Lo'ak, come on.

02:36:09.410 --> 02:36:11.090
- Do not follow me.
- Come on!

02:36:41.040 --> 02:36:42.800
- Lo'ak, they're coming.
- Fight with us.

02:36:46.620 --> 02:36:49.500
- Go. I'll stay with her.
- Come on.

02:37:03.390 --> 02:37:05.950
Oh, Mother, hear my words.

02:37:07.670 --> 02:37:09.570
Please help us.

02:37:10.308 --> 02:37:11.308
I beg you..

02:37:11.970 --> 02:37:13.990
You are our only hope.

02:37:27.740 --> 02:37:29.980
Please! We need you.

02:37:32.060 --> 02:37:33.520
Don't push me away.

02:37:38.540 --> 02:37:41.260
Please don't. No, please.

02:37:49.835 --> 02:37:50.835
No, no!

02:37:51.770 --> 02:37:55.130
No.
Monkey boy..?

02:37:55.450 --> 02:37:58.010
- Let's do this. Come on!

02:38:00.890 --> 02:38:01.950
Come on.

02:38:03.332 --> 02:38:04.332
- Fire!

02:38:19.990 --> 02:38:22.010
I beg you. Please.

02:38:26.250 --> 02:38:29.450
No, please! The people are dying.

02:38:38.090 --> 02:38:39.730
Please. No!

02:38:42.170 --> 02:38:43.070
Tuk..

02:38:43.071 --> 02:38:44.071
- Come on

02:38:44.367 --> 02:38:45.367
Come on!

02:38:46.120 --> 02:38:47.200
We can do this.

02:38:50.300 --> 02:38:51.580
Sullys never quit!

02:39:09.390 --> 02:39:11.030
- Come on, let's go

02:39:11.218 --> 02:39:12.958
- Tuk...
- Come on!

02:39:32.000 --> 02:39:35.040
Great Mother, help us.
We beg you.

02:39:36.360 --> 02:39:37.880
The people are dying!

02:39:40.440 --> 02:39:42.346
I call upon the Warrior Mother.

02:39:42.370 --> 02:39:44.280
You are our only hope.

02:40:44.980 --> 02:40:46.120
Fire.

02:40:56.395 --> 02:40:57.755
(Muffled) Nooooo!

02:41:01.250 --> 02:41:02.690
That's him.
Get after him.

02:41:08.350 --> 02:41:09.620
Flank aft, box him in.

02:41:18.771 --> 02:41:20.691
(Screaming in pain)

02:41:40.474 --> 02:41:41.474
Sa'ata!

02:41:42.090 --> 02:41:44.170
Good girl. Good girl.

02:42:00.410 --> 02:42:02.013
- You okay?
- Yes.

02:42:03.237 --> 02:42:05.530
- Where's Kiri?

02:42:10.120 --> 02:42:11.340
Jake, I'm down.

02:42:12.717 --> 02:42:13.717
Get to safety.

02:42:14.500 --> 02:42:15.560
- Do not attack.

02:42:18.340 --> 02:42:19.360
We're done.

02:42:38.574 --> 02:42:39.574
- Dad!

02:42:40.934 --> 02:42:42.134
- Lo'ak..
- Dad!

02:42:43.550 --> 02:42:45.030
It's okay. It's okay. I got you.

02:42:46.656 --> 02:42:48.556
(Pained sounds)

02:42:52.674 --> 02:42:53.674
- Tsahìk?

02:43:06.720 --> 02:43:08.188
Stay here. I'm going back for her.

02:43:08.312 --> 02:43:09.940
- You can't leave me by myself.

02:43:20.040 --> 02:43:21.080
Sa'ata, wait.

02:43:26.330 --> 02:43:28.650
- I am dying.
- No, you're not.

02:43:30.290 --> 02:43:33.650
- Why must you always argue? I am..

02:43:34.130 --> 02:43:37.890
I am dying.
But first, I will push out this baby.

02:43:38.715 --> 02:43:39.715
(Groaning)

02:43:47.040 --> 02:43:48.380
Then push!

02:43:50.860 --> 02:43:51.980
I got you. I got you.

02:43:57.980 --> 02:44:01.660
- I'm gonna pull it on three.
- No, don't. Don't. just don't.

02:44:01.740 --> 02:44:03.020
I gotta pack the wound.

02:44:16.950 --> 02:44:20.230
Kiri, Kiri, Kiri.

02:44:29.030 --> 02:44:30.110
Are you okay?

02:44:32.630 --> 02:44:33.630
Good.

02:44:35.226 --> 02:44:36.266
Push, Tsahìk!

02:44:37.812 --> 02:44:39.332
(Screaming in pain)

02:44:41.260 --> 02:44:42.620
You have one more push.

02:44:43.543 --> 02:44:44.543
(Screaming)

02:44:44.700 --> 02:44:47.420
- She's coming. She's coming.

02:44:51.400 --> 02:44:52.400
Take your child.

02:44:59.080 --> 02:45:00.120
Thank you...

02:45:01.904 --> 02:45:02.904
Neytiri..

02:45:03.830 --> 02:45:04.870
Thank you.

02:45:06.511 --> 02:45:07.791
(Pained sounds)

02:45:09.030 --> 02:45:10.070
What is her name?

02:45:11.732 --> 02:45:12.732
She...

02:45:13.190 --> 02:45:14.390
She is Pril.

02:45:17.510 --> 02:45:18.550
Be strong.

02:45:23.970 --> 02:45:25.930
Pril is a good name.

02:45:27.254 --> 02:45:28.840
- You will protect her?

02:45:30.853 --> 02:45:31.853
Yes.

02:45:39.360 --> 02:45:47.400
(Pril crying)

02:45:55.330 --> 02:45:57.146
Dad. I'm - I'm sorry I left my post.

02:45:57.170 --> 02:45:59.771
- It's okay, son.
- No-

02:45:59.795 --> 02:46:01.730
- You've proven yourself to me.

02:46:03.330 --> 02:46:06.070
I mean, getting the tulkun to fight.

02:46:07.410 --> 02:46:09.380
Toruk Makto couldn't do it.

02:46:09.404 --> 02:46:14.050
Hey, you did it.
I'm proud of you.

02:46:39.268 --> 02:46:40.308
(Tuk screams)

02:46:42.620 --> 02:46:44.730
22. What's your status? Casualties?

02:46:45.754 --> 02:46:47.563
- All right, people,

02:46:48.087 --> 02:46:49.580
Let's get ourselves together.

02:46:49.604 --> 02:46:51.310
We've still got work to do.

02:46:52.282 --> 02:46:53.282
Seriously?!

02:46:55.330 --> 02:46:57.905
There's a hundred billion
dollars waiting in that cove

02:46:57.929 --> 02:47:00.372
and nothing standing in our way.

02:47:01.995 --> 02:47:03.270
Beers are on me.

02:47:05.610 --> 02:47:07.770
Your name is Pril.

02:47:09.190 --> 02:47:12.063
Your mother was powerful.
You will be powerful too.

02:47:12.087 --> 02:47:13.200
- Mrs. Sully!
(Gasps)

02:47:32.800 --> 02:47:34.540
Spoils of war.

02:47:35.267 --> 02:47:36.267
Dad!

02:47:36.310 --> 02:47:37.450
Dad look,

02:47:49.330 --> 02:47:53.130
I need you now, by my side.

02:47:53.630 --> 02:47:55.850
I need my wingman.

02:47:56.450 --> 02:47:57.970
- Okay.
- Let's move out.

02:48:05.546 --> 02:48:06.746
(Pained sounds)

02:48:11.252 --> 02:48:12.252
Jake?

02:48:12.620 --> 02:48:15.260
I know you're out there.
I know you can hear me.

02:48:16.380 --> 02:48:18.780
Varang here is lighting up
your wife pretty good.

02:48:19.603 --> 02:48:20.963
(Neytiri screams)

02:48:25.162 --> 02:48:26.162
- Nooo!

02:48:28.230 --> 02:48:31.590
Now, I want you to come in
and I want you to bring Spider with you,

02:48:32.090 --> 02:48:34.070
and I know you copy that.

02:48:35.430 --> 02:48:36.510
Thanks, baby.

02:48:36.676 --> 02:48:38.176
(Neytiri panting)
(Pril crying)

02:48:42.150 --> 02:48:44.470
Picadors, get in there! Go go!

02:48:44.908 --> 02:48:45.908
Go!

02:48:59.890 --> 02:49:01.046
They're trapping them.

02:49:01.170 --> 02:49:03.390
Let's get those heifers herded in tight.

02:49:19.940 --> 02:49:22.980
100 meters. Get me in there.
Get me in range.

02:49:25.845 --> 02:49:26.845
Shit!

02:49:29.700 --> 02:49:32.420
Matadors, ahead slow.
Even spacing.

02:49:34.500 --> 02:49:36.820
Sub teams.
Torpedoes ready.

02:49:37.380 --> 02:49:40.340
- Arm torpedoes.
- Arming one-through-four. Torpedoes armed.

02:49:40.500 --> 02:49:43.060
60 meters. Target lock.

02:49:50.330 --> 02:49:51.510
Safety's off.

02:49:54.890 --> 02:49:56.170
Stand by to fire.

02:50:07.530 --> 02:50:08.550
Look, look.

02:50:23.880 --> 02:50:24.540
- Hold your fire!

02:50:24.575 --> 02:50:26.095
Hold fire for what?

02:50:26.379 --> 02:50:30.200
- We've got a situation down here..
- It's Eywa. It worked.

02:50:31.240 --> 02:50:32.320
It worked!

02:50:53.650 --> 02:50:56.290
- Look out!
- Get us out of here!

02:50:57.098 --> 02:50:58.098
(Screaming)

02:51:17.900 --> 02:51:21.180
Go, go, go. Hit it!
All boats back to the ship.

02:51:21.380 --> 02:51:23.040
All boats back to the ship!

02:51:25.578 --> 02:51:26.578
Yeah!

02:51:26.710 --> 02:51:27.910
That's right, buttholes.

02:52:25.880 --> 02:52:28.400
- Get us out of here.
- Can't. Propulsion's down.

02:53:05.839 --> 02:53:07.739
(Screaming)

02:53:27.448 --> 02:53:29.015
- I need power. Get me back up!

02:53:31.090 --> 02:53:34.050
- General, Flex Devil's pulling us in.

02:53:36.700 --> 02:53:39.900
- Abandon ship.
- Abandon ship!

02:53:46.300 --> 02:53:47.340
Stay close.

02:53:58.220 --> 02:53:59.260
Stay close.

02:54:01.910 --> 02:54:04.230
- Clear.
- Clear.

02:54:10.462 --> 02:54:11.462
Tuck in!

02:54:11.870 --> 02:54:13.390
- Get to the lifeboat.
Get off the ship!

02:54:13.958 --> 02:54:14.558
- Run!

02:54:16.610 --> 02:54:18.344
Death, Fire, Death, Death!

02:54:18.671 --> 02:54:19.406
Death, Fire, Fire, Death!

02:54:19.430 --> 02:54:21.510
Death, Fire, Fire, Death!
Okay, I'll need covering fire.

02:54:22.390 --> 02:54:24.813
Okay, I'm gonna push left

02:54:24.837 --> 02:54:26.938
down the port side
and get around behind them.

02:54:26.962 --> 02:54:29.105
- Get eyes on me. Just watch me.
- Yes, sir.

02:54:29.129 --> 02:54:31.960
- And.. don't shoot anyone you love.

02:54:32.210 --> 02:54:33.210
Go, go!

02:54:45.720 --> 02:54:48.938
Colonel, this is Spider. I'm here.

02:54:48.962 --> 02:54:50.280
Don't kill them.

02:54:53.004 --> 02:54:55.570
Where are you, boy?
Step out now.

02:54:57.890 --> 02:54:59.650
All right. I'll come out.

02:55:01.031 --> 02:55:05.131
(Varang trilling and chanting)

02:55:12.370 --> 02:55:16.130
Spider, you hear me?
We're running out of time.

